f5e2ed88411"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Marco Bonardo \u003cmbonardo@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055050 - Convert PageIconProtocolHandler to SimpleChannel. r=places-reviewers,daisuke\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316254\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/places/PageIconProtocolHandler.cpp", "toolkit/components/places/tests/chrome/chrome.toml", "toolkit/components/places/tests/chrome/test_page_icon.xhtml"], "git_node": "b677c5215e97172d7193ae2906d1fd811e2f3f84", "git_parents": ["10fee4102ad2bceb08fd663faec9965009ac818c"], "node": "2b68470b9b08a638dd11797a7e2e284bcdd86b23", "parents": ["dde61ada534f42906a7f26763536bab418ad1fae"], "tags": []}, {"author": "agoloman \u003cagoloman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2045044 - Part 2 - Ensure clang plugin for FINAL cycle collecting macros scans all of DOM r=dom-core-reviewers,smaug\" for causing build bustages @OSXSpeechSynthesizerService.mm. IGNORE BAD COMMIT MESSAGES\n\nThis reverts commit 233725e9cd9c59d623103660917141519c389f81.\n", "files": ["build/clang-plugin/FinalCycleCollectingIsupportsChecker.cpp"], "git_node": "7a2d62ff3c3fcbdd1575b6af9b0ef05da21d0ad6", "git_parents": ["b677c5215e97172d7193ae2906d1fd811e2f3f84"], "node": "403254d488cd405d155df2d71befdaebcf45f48c", "parents": ["2b68470b9b08a638dd11797a7e2e284bcdd86b23"], "tags": []}, {"author": "agoloman \u003cagoloman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 1940240 - Part 5: Enable container-timing web platform tests. r=canova\" for causing wpt failures @containertiming-large-container-size.html. IGNORE BAD COMMIT MESSAGES\n\nThis reverts commit d51b3f7b4b1f0cb0867f421c79e145f034cb7d36.\n\nRevert \"Bug 1940240 - Part 4: Record container-timing paints from the layout paint pipeline. r=layout-reviewers,emilio\"\n\nThis reverts commit 26a59da95256d3b4be701b1514626358d84108d2.\n\nRevert \"Bug 1940240 - Part 3: Implement the Container Timing API behind a pref. r=smaug,webidl,saschanaz\"\n\nThis reverts commit 51568e3f54156407b174efe2840988b08cac0f7d.\n\nRevert \"Bug 1940240 - Part 2: Compute rect and region areas in 64-bit to avoid overflow. r=gfx-reviewers,bradwerth,lsalzman\"\n\nThis reverts commit c419214bb9ed840765a48696bfe07b551f50a48f.\n\nRevert \"Bug 1940240 - Part 1: Centralize reduced-precision timestamp conversion on Performance. r=canova\"\n\nThis reverts commit 49261c7747c33e09d9ee9ab5c3f6d42ace6b4d93.\n", "files": ["dom/base/Document.cpp", "dom/base/Document.h", "dom/base/Element.cpp", "dom/base/Element.h", "dom/base/nsGlobalWindowInner.cpp", "dom/base/nsINode.cpp", "dom/base/nsPIDOMWindow.h", "dom/html/nsGenericHTMLElement.cpp", "dom/html/nsGenericHTMLElement.h", "dom/performance/LargestContentfulPaint.cpp", "dom/performance/Performance.cpp", "dom/performance/Performance.h", "dom/performance/PerformanceContainerTiming.cpp", "dom/performance/PerformanceContainerTiming.h", "dom/performance/PerformanceMainThread.cpp", "dom/performance/PerformanceMainThread.h", "dom/performance/PerformanceObserver.cpp", "dom/performance/moz.build", "dom/webidl/HTMLElement.webidl", "dom/webidl/PerformanceContainerTiming.webidl", "dom/webidl/moz.build", "gfx/2d/BaseRect.h", "gfx/2d/RectAbsolute.h", "gfx/src/nsRegion.cpp", "gfx/tests/gtest/TestRect.cpp", "gfx/tests/gtest/TestRegion.cpp", "layout/base/PresShell.cpp", "layout/generic/nsHTMLCanvasFrame.cpp", "layout/generic/nsImageFrame.cpp", "layout/generic/nsVideoFrame.cpp", "layout/painting/nsDisplayList.cpp", "layout/svg/SVGImageFrame.cpp", "modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml", "testing/web-platform/meta/container-timing/tentative/__dir__.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/container-timing/tentative/containertiming-and-ignore-on-img-itself.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/container-timing/tentative/containertiming-and-ignore-on-text-itself.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/container-timing/tentative/containertiming-body-with-child-img.html.ini", "testing/web-pl