 Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318486\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/test/forms/browser.toml", "browser/base/content/test/forms/browser_selectpopup_color_scheme.js", "dom/base/ChromeUtils.cpp", "widget/LookAndFeel.h", "widget/nsXPLookAndFeel.cpp"], "git_node": "fda7a108cb5924b19fe6650b2fa03a79dc3418f1", "git_parents": ["1aedade048d6d37a9566061d27785362af21cf72"], "node": "b714eeffaa76ec71497b090f7aeccf7edb04b76c", "parents": ["a20f60896bdd8ad2e78e0295eee985adff05574e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059521 - Push the check to nsNativeTheme::IsDarkBackground. r=layout-reviewers,dshin\n\nThis changes the behavior of scrollbar color-scheme detection but I\nthink it's the right thing to do.\n\nWanted to split it from the previous commit tho since it has a bit of a\nlarger blast radius.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318487\n", "files": ["dom/base/ChromeUtils.cpp", "widget/nsNativeTheme.cpp"], "git_node": "cb1652efcbe4b7be6089af3d91257c1a7d2e1d7b", "git_parents": ["fda7a108cb5924b19fe6650b2fa03a79dc3418f1"], "node": "eef6aa36af3cbda8024b65e8396a6087e217ac5b", "parents": ["b714eeffaa76ec71497b090f7aeccf7edb04b76c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "agoloman \u003cagoloman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2058723 - AITab generation code r=Mardak,ai-platform-reviewers,fluent-reviewers,flod,thasan\" for causing bc failures @browser_aitab_generation.js. IGNORE BAD COMMIT MESSAGES\n\nThis reverts commit 18b914c1818605f4136c8ab372a9ea1b07bb7344.\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/Chat.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/PromptLoader.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/Tools.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/Utils.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/aitab/AITab.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/aitab/component_schema.json", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/aitab/jar.mn", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/aitab/moz.build", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/moz.build", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/browser/aitab_viewer_stub.html", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/browser/browser_aitab_generation.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/browser/browser_aitab_schema_override.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/browser/browser_aitab_validation.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/xpcshell/test_aitab_parse.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/xpcshell/test_aitab_viewer.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/xpcshell/xpcshell.toml", "browser/locales-preview/aiWindow.ftl", "toolkit/components/ml/content/EngineProcess.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "269f9eeac2b99302b7dde5492ff6c8bc39d0897d", "git_parents": ["cb1652efcbe4b7be6089af3d91257c1a7d2e1d7b"], "node": "c6331a5b1457f811ff88adf2b819828c76fd6b6b", "parents": ["eef6aa36af3cbda8024b65e8396a6087e217ac5b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "agoloman \u003cagoloman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2030542, Bug 2062193, Bug 2062191, Bug 2062186, Bug 2062189 - Wait for the favicon to reach the top sites list in browser_ext_topSites.js, and re-enable the test on linux x11 opt, r=extension-reviewers,rpl.\" for causing bc failures @browser_ext_url_overrides_newtab.js. IGNORE BAD COMMIT MESSAGES\n\nThis reverts commit ba2c3a5b0735e67b4fd904a6fd324a9f79c44cf1.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2062193 - Expect windows.update() to clamp an off-screen position to the screen's available area in browser_ext_windows_size.js, and re-enable the test on mac, r=extension-reviewers,rpl.\"\n\nThis reverts commit 36ffcad0ba0cb10d8348d99fbe0095359e03fcf4.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2062191 - Use fake media streams in browser_ext_webrtc.js and re-enable it on mac, r=extension-reviewers,rpl.\"\n\nThis reverts commit f22844d2d7c42