rings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-tg/strings.xml"], "git_node": "3bbeceb9e6c0cf190523308fefd099380b984853", "git_parents": ["3d198cf40406d831af756f13ed2254114c5798dd"], "node": "3fe74e8d7436e9ae3c3b5ddd152afaf79296a145", "parents": ["bdf624470f9b9de5d960ad3711540dab76f3311f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sotaro Ikeda \u003csotaro.ikeda.g@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063174 - Add device reset check in RendererOGL::UpdateAndRender() during taking screenshot r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\n\nAdd device reset check in RendererOGL::UpdateAndRender() during taking screenshot for Bug 2041424.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318375\n", "files": ["gfx/2d/Types.h", "gfx/webrender_bindings/RenderThread.cpp", "gfx/webrender_bindings/RendererOGL.cpp"], "git_node": "2331354b8449e6698d16b257ae1e407635f999d2", "git_parents": ["3bbeceb9e6c0cf190523308fefd099380b984853"], "node": "e1ce1427000aaca1361faedfc3492a6dc48004e8", "parents": ["3fe74e8d7436e9ae3c3b5ddd152afaf79296a145"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Zia \u003cfzia@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061776 - Fallback for scroll-driven-animations in ai-action-confirmation r=omarg\n\nMirror the smartbar fallback for scroll-driven animations: JS controlls a scroll-progress custom property when animation-timeline: scroll() is not available.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318536\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/test/static/browser_parsable_css.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-action-confirmation/ai-action-confirmation.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-action-confirmation/ai-action-confirmation.mjs"], "git_node": "d92503cb344b2587778c318f97e653295a67f6b2", "git_parents": ["2331354b8449e6698d16b257ae1e407635f999d2"], "node": "5d0fd83aa216640bee397645f3898ada9b238a57", "parents": ["e1ce1427000aaca1361faedfc3492a6dc48004e8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephen Thompson \u003csthompson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057857 - skip browser_477657.js on Linux 22.04 Wayland r=jswinarton\n\nFails inconsistently across multiple configurations:\n\n- opt or debug\n- Nova enabled or Nova disabled\n\nThis test is also already skipped for Linux 24.04 X11. For Linux 22.04 Wayland, at least, the issue appears to be a race. It sets a window sizemode (e.g. to maximized) and then asserts the sizemode after a zero setTimeout. This test could be more stable if it awaited the expected sizemode instead of asserting it after setTimeout, but given that there are some other tests not receiving sizemode changes at all under Linux 22.04 Wayland, I think it's simpler to skip this test in Linux 22.04 in general.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318332\n", "files": ["browser/components/sessionstore/test/browser_oldformat.toml"], "git_node": "6668a8d4e0ee592077c94a84dd737a58cf0fe436", "git_parents": ["d92503cb344b2587778c318f97e653295a67f6b2"], "node": "ab086738774588944c6c1236ede8d06f66ba9914", "parents": ["5d0fd83aa216640bee397645f3898ada9b238a57"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Maxx Crawford \u003cmcrawford@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061741 - Create the side-by-side newtab layout experiment r=thecount\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318483\n", "files": ["browser/components/newtab/metrics.yaml", "browser/extensions/newtab/common/PageLayoutVariants.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/common/WidgetsRegistry.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Base/Base.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Base/_Grid.scss", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/DiscoveryStreamBase/DiscoveryStreamBase.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/DiscoveryStreamBase/_DiscoveryStreamBase.scss", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Widgets/Widgets.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src