lt", "desc": "Bug 2058085 - Pick about:pdf files in the parent process. r=mossop,fluent-reviewers,flod\n\nMove the file picker and PDF validation to AboutPDFParent so content never supplies a local path. Leave dropped PDFs to native drop handling.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318472\n", "files": ["toolkit/actors/AboutPDFChild.sys.mjs", "toolkit/actors/AboutPDFParent.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/aboutpdf/content/aboutPDF.html", "toolkit/components/aboutpdf/content/aboutPDF.mjs", "toolkit/components/aboutpdf/tests/browser/browser_aboutPDF.js", "toolkit/components/aboutpdf/tests/browser/browser_aboutPDF_actor.js", "toolkit/components/aboutpdf/tests/browser/head.js", "toolkit/locales/en-US/toolkit/about/aboutPDF.ftl", "toolkit/modules/RemotePageAccessManager.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "aeffc52fd7ccff668fbb5e6b18fa176a0cf5ebed", "git_parents": ["7baa0ba030d6d040b3f8d046129fe748c383e79a"], "node": "a9ebf01be3451ee280b71d5956a2c8a3e72ca7f1", "parents": ["273655dd7d4766865a0b1af428fe10eb3e18126c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Updatebot \u003cupdatebot@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063588 - Update android nightly application-services version bump to 6c3d4cd1b6c488e8b82959caee30d77e152e56ce r=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318716\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/plugins/dependencies/src/main/java/ApplicationServices.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/plugins/dependencies/src/main/java/moz.yaml"], "git_node": "b7c283fcfdea97458f7aecbc2a5fe078ee3dc60a", "git_parents": ["aeffc52fd7ccff668fbb5e6b18fa176a0cf5ebed"], "node": "d4de107f9c2023d6df19c6db8ece200be39aea48", "parents": ["a9ebf01be3451ee280b71d5956a2c8a3e72ca7f1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rong Bao \u003cwebmaster@csmantle.top\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063239 - [loong64] Part 1: (Drive-by) Normalize naming of \"scratch\" and \"scratch2\". r=jandem\n\nName the one allocated earlier \"scratch\" and the other one \"scratch2\".\nThis should be a pure renaming with no runtime effect.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318415\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/loong64/MacroAssembler-loong64.cpp"], "git_node": "5269f5c02bf9d273bd06f762a7a1f53cbab6db24", "git_parents": ["b7c283fcfdea97458f7aecbc2a5fe078ee3dc60a"], "node": "4bd95faefd45986a44cc2b0cfd59da37d4715ced", "parents": ["d4de107f9c2023d6df19c6db8ece200be39aea48"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rong Bao \u003cwebmaster@csmantle.top\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063239 - [loong64] Part 2: (Drive-by) Fix bad int32 range assertions. r=jandem\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318416\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/loong64/MacroAssembler-loong64.cpp"], "git_node": "a767fe78905e24ad56fc3539bae9d540d1d3463a", "git_parents": ["5269f5c02bf9d273bd06f762a7a1f53cbab6db24"], "node": "acb34bdfac2b7c7a19c12f511de0b4a786ffa527", "parents": ["4bd95faefd45986a44cc2b0cfd59da37d4715ced"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rong Bao \u003cwebmaster@csmantle.top\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063239 - [loong64] Part 3: Remove redundant sign extension in CodeGenerator::visitSignExtendInt64. r=jandem\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318417\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/loong64/CodeGenerator-loong64.cpp"], "git_node": "c3ddc353fe4472a00572f84edee821413d168b34", "git_parents": ["a767fe78905e24ad56fc3539bae9d540d1d3463a"], "node": "b360b10b182f08381695c0b848a242bbaa0998dc", "parents": ["acb34bdfac2b7c7a19c12f511de0b4a786ffa527"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rong Bao \u003cwebmaster@csmantle.top\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063239 - [loong64] Part 4: Handle small and mask-like immediates in CodeGenerator::visitBitOpI64. r=jandem\n\nFuse the small immediates directly into the operation instruction\nitself. Also, use BSTRPICK.D to simplify immediates with a single chunk\nof 1s.\n\nA codegen test is added to verify the results.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318418\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/binop-loong64-ion-codegen.js", "js/src/jit/loong64/CodeGenerator-loong64.cpp", "js/src/jit/loong64/MacroAssembler-loong64-inl.h"], "git_node": "607660cccdd811ab47d220642140ea75309219c7", "git_parents": ["c3ddc353fe4472a00572f84edee821413d168b34"], "node": "58a7f0c4866aeda3999e18d8e17806af1e475677", "parents": ["b360b10b182f08381695c0b848a242bbaa0998dc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rong Bao \u003cwebmaster@csmantle.top\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063239 - [loong64] Part 5: Improve binop codegen test coverage. r=jandem\n\nThe patterns added are largely borrowed from\nwasm/binop-{arm64,x64}-ion-codegen.js.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318419\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/binop-loong64-ion-codegen.js"], "git_node": "b384ee4ca2e7ecc72c89d960dbbceec284d2abad", "git_parents": ["607660cccdd811ab47d220642140ea75309219c7"], "node": "2a07e7c2d4938d86dbfb79398c896d56b59c3983", "parents": ["58a7f0c4866aeda3999e18d8e17806af1e475677"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rong Bao \u003cwebmaster@csmantle.top\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063239 - [loong64] Part 6: Add BSTRPICK.D shortcut to ma_add(Register, Register, Imm32). r=jandem\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318420\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/binop-loong64-ion-codegen.js", "js/src/jit/loong64/MacroAssembler-loong64.cpp"], "git_node": "9562d9c41756f5ad0574c35e524b1ea14691ab85", "git_parents": ["b384ee4ca2e7ecc72c89d960dbbceec284d2abad"], "node": "9395efde55a68ed6a06505631a5751be74f972e2", "parents": ["2a07e7c2d4938d86dbfb79398c896d56b59c3983"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rong Bao \u003cwebmaster@csmantle.top\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063239 - [loong64] Part 7: Add shortcuts to branchTest{32,Ptr}. r=jandem\n\nBoth of these functions has various callers with small or bitmask-like\nImm32/ImmWord input. These can also benefit from the new shortcuts.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318421\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/binop-loong64-ion-codegen.js", "js/src/jit/loong64/MacroAssembler-loong64-inl.h"], "git_node": "c27f4b9ef3b6ac2b657351f4f39f14d4528ff568", "git_parents": ["9562d9c41756f5ad0574c35e524b1ea14691ab85"], "node": "4bd1fea166b495bd910a8c1d3eb32344bec9a478", "parents": ["9395efde55a68ed6a06505631a5751be74f972e2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058486 - Work around a behavior difference on freetype versions older than 2.14. r=lsalzman\n\nSkPDFStrike::Make disables bitmaps[1], which would cause us to pass\nFT_LOAD_NO_BITMAP unconditionally.\n\nOlder versions of Freetype will honor the flag even for bitmap-only\nfonts, causing the font load to fail. This was fixed on freetype commit\n4ef8eed11 [2].\n\nIn order to match the newer freetype behavior on older freetype, don't\nspecify FT_LOAD_NO_BITMAP for bitmap-only (!FT_IS_SCALABLE) fonts.\n\n[1]: https://searchfox.org/firefox-main/rev/25d7109bf565c299435dec3dd2b9e79a1ce7c15d/gfx/skia/skia/src/pdf/SkPDFFont.cpp#151,167\n[2]: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/freetype/freetype/-/commit/4ef8eed11\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318618\n", "files": ["gfx/skia/skia/src/ports/SkFontHost_cairo.cpp"], "git_node": "3944320f40efb3426c887b628a0fed0f1271cadd", "git_parents": ["c27f4b9ef3b6ac2b657351f4f39f14d4528ff568"], "node": "a5f3d1a1fa72ece27ee3cf0a3004b599677fed45", "parents": ["4bd1fea166b495bd910a8c1d3eb32344bec9a478"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrea Marchesini \u003camarchesini@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062099 - \"Add new container\" context menu option does not work from Library window or old sidebar r=places-reviewers,Standard8\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317439\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/utilityOverlay.js", "browser/components/contextualidentity/content/ContainerCreationPanel.mjs", "browser/components/places/tests/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/places/tests/browser/browser_library_container_menu.js"], "git_node": "6aa30069a56f23947adf807137a471ecd64feb10", "git_parents": ["3944320f40efb3426c887b628a0fed0f1271cadd"], "node": "782c7e4b669b4396097f8da18faf9afa3b2b68c6", "parents": ["a5f3d1a1fa72ece27ee3cf0a3004b599677fed45"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrea Marchesini \u003camarchesini@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056232 - Do not expose IP Protection feature if not fully translated r=sstreich,ip-protection-reviewers,bolsson,firefox-desktop-core-reviewers ,mossop\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312985\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "browser/components/BrowserGlue.sys.mjs", "browser/components/ProfileDataUpgrader.sys.mjs", "browser/components/ipprotection/IPPL10nHelper.sys.mjs", "browser/components/ipprotection/IPProtectionHelpers.sys.mjs", "browser/components/ipprotection/moz.build", "browser/components/ipprotection/tests/browser/browser_ipprotection_content.js", "browser/components/ipprotection/tests/xpcshell/test_IPPL10nHelper.js", "browser/components/ipprotection/tests/xpcshell/xpcshell.toml", "browser/components/tests/unit/test_browserGlue_migration_ippL10nCoverage.js", "browser/components/tests/unit/xpcshell.toml", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/IPPNimbusHelper.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/IPProtectionService.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/docs/Components.md", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/docs/Preferences.md", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/docs/StateMachine.md", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/tests/xpcshell/test_IPProtectionStates.js"], "git_node": "9f6ca24184e2b2b90e37f61b85844afdf91f4cf5", "git_parents": ["6aa30069a56f23947adf807137a471ecd64feb10"], "node": "2d0c58c03e72ace0be872d83