 {"author": "Jon Coppeard \u003cjcoppeard@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061300 - Make ProxyObject::renew work when called on dying objects r=jandem\n\nThis is similar to other places where we call setMayHavePointersToDeadCells().\nWe may end up remapping dying proxy objects so if we insert a storebuffer entry\nwe need to set this flag so we'll empty the nursery before we sweep the object.\n\nThe patch also makes a change to the shell to supply a rewrap callback that\ncalls Wrapper::Renew on existing proxies, like the browser does.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318478\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/gc/bug-2061300.js", "js/src/proxy/Proxy.cpp", "js/src/shell/js.cpp"], "git_node": "3dbb00f016f3da58d7a83affc0ba0d7ad83065b5", "git_parents": ["e3839b779c59be62178be4f3bd66cc408df9728f"], "node": "b86bcce644d695f7311a02deae7d3b3e587125fc", "parents": ["75ccd62b0f67db98e01d0ac22ab0bd7dda80921b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "AndiAJ \u003candiaj@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063613 - Fix verifyTheMainMenuBackButtonLongClickFromCustomTabTest efficiency UI test r=jajohnson\n\nThe test tried to tap the \"Go to target page\" link the instant the page loaded, but sometimes the link wasn't clickable yet, so the tap missed and the test failed.\nThe test now waits for the link to actually be there before tapping it.\n\nThe UI test successfully passed 50x on Firebase \u2705\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318731\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/pageObjects/CustomTabsPage.kt"], "git_node": "e2b5e1810be36702857c03ac997b9d14fd22c582", "git_parents": ["3dbb00f016f3da58d7a83affc0ba0d7ad83065b5"], "node": "077aa6c87d800257d63a9b33f3f1de21b152b1cc", "parents": ["b86bcce644d695f7311a02deae7d3b3e587125fc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Matthew Gaudet \u003cmgaudet@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063370 - emit_Resume can hoist the barrier check r=jandem\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318522\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/BaselineCodeGen.cpp"], "git_node": "266f65f2bd87b099756bc781200b4ac32978a928", "git_parents": ["e2b5e1810be36702857c03ac997b9d14fd22c582"], "node": "8c01c19c86e48a16483e28b9499a17aba478f0a9", "parents": ["077aa6c87d800257d63a9b33f3f1de21b152b1cc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Kaply \u003cmozilla@kaply.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1980406 - Add FirefoxHome.Widgets policy for new tab widgets r=jmendez\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316903\n", "files": ["browser/components/enterprisepolicies/Policies.sys.mjs", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/schemas/policies-schema.json", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/browser/browser_policy_firefoxhome.js", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/xpcshell/test_simple_pref_policies.js"], "git_node": "6f47fe5e54d380285a641b278fe1b7b3b064ead1", "git_parents": ["266f65f2bd87b099756bc781200b4ac32978a928"], "node": "8f10a04d4f2fecd277fb69b1ff9b5450f63e3a86", "parents": ["8c01c19c86e48a16483e28b9499a17aba478f0a9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dharma Ong \u003cdharmaong00@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061818 - Rename UrlbarInput.mjs to UrlbarInputBase.mjs. r=dao,urlbar-reviewers\n\nPure file rename (no content change) done as its own commit so git records\na rename rather than a copy, preserving the module's blame and history. The\nbase-class extraction and the new UrlbarInput subclass follow in the next\ncommit.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318556\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/browser-main.js", "browser/components/search/OpenSearchManager.sys.mjs", "browser/components/search/SearchUIUtils.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/UrlbarParentController.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/content/SmartbarInput.mjs", "browser/c