ug 2058693 - updated default_config_env for v152\n", "files": ["dom/media/webrtc/third_party_build/default_config_env"], "git_node": "e06ee264912fccdd8388dbe2bc643548f3094373", "git_parents": ["b401d5a32fe5b848e3e1281a940d24774cbc842f"], "node": "644a0714336bdefdfe3701dc43f6e622163f6a9b", "parents": ["e935f43482afb262d63a17ab86e7410db4629e75"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 11fe04a72f\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/11fe04a72fd8117fdb77a7e69a030205087001d1\n    Update WebRTC code version (2026-06-29T04:06:53).\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I09d40c6b41686d31cf47f1b6780bff441fd6c1da\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/486380\n    Bot-Commit: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48104}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/version.cc"], "git_node": "76f83ffa2e131f47dfc8367bfd9d7730764e218f", "git_parents": ["e06ee264912fccdd8388dbe2bc643548f3094373"], "node": "d1017951513d6d4fe8451f01968f4f33927fa5a3", "parents": ["644a0714336bdefdfe3701dc43f6e622163f6a9b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 8a831ad192\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/8a831ad19204f7939ceb6920a9e76e0756c063e1\n    CryptoOptions: expose preferGcmCryptoSuites in Android SDK\n\n    Wires the new prefer_gcm_crypto_suites CryptoOptions flag through the\n    Java CryptoOptions builder and the JNI converter so Android clients\n    can opt into GCM-preferred SRTP cipher ordering.\n\n    Also match the defaults to the C++ equivalents which enables GCM-based suites by default.\n\n    Co-Authored-by: lgr@threema.ch\n    Bug: webrtc:42221827\n    Change-Id: I79eed0554b3f4eae92ece123a3789c6522bf1c00\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/474281\n    Reviewed-by: Fredrik Solenberg \u003csolenberg@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Zo\u00e9 Lepaul \u003czlep@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Philipp Hancke \u003cphilipp.hancke@googlemail.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48105}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/CryptoOptions.java"], "git_node": "300833180bcedfb87751b76f1965e8ae7d25dec2", "git_parents": ["76f83ffa2e131f47dfc8367bfd9d7730764e218f"], "node": "bbbfd662539f11681b4807842debe5959e1ee099", "parents": ["d1017951513d6d4fe8451f01968f4f33927fa5a3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 81913b18d7\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/81913b18d728913643f55f42f71f55f68a7cdad4\n    Roll chromium_revision de9ca05d59..e5b192ff6e (1653784:1653906)\n\n    Change log: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+log/de9ca05d59..e5b192ff6e\n    Full diff: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/de9ca05d59..e5b192ff6e\n\n    Changed dependencies\n    * src/build: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/build/+log/8edf031b7f..6bb98d0865\n    * src/buildtools/linux64: git_revision:ed2a73266f1d9a0aeeebc3e1e07045848a62254e..git_revision:e331ddb6e93389abfc75c611690bb82f5274029e\n    * src/buildtools/mac: git_revision:ed2a73266f1d9a0aeeebc3e1e07045848a62254e..git_revision:e331ddb6e93389abfc75c611690bb82f5274029e\n    * src/buildtools/win: git_revision:ed2a73266f1d9a0aeeebc3e1e07045848a62254e..git_revision:e331ddb6e93389abfc75c611690bb82f5274029e\n    * src/testing: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chrom