28}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/DEPS", "third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor"], "git_node": "668f7c402699305680398d289c145b44eda8c775", "git_parents": ["eaadf85b539ddc01bf64237e9361d0c815f49ba8"], "node": "f81293428ba5bd0d1de3894a332d56668d2cd699", "parents": ["24c8d8d4d1a3a1fca96c476ac029910b8cc16a35"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 3b43c84ddd\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/3b43c84ddd4ecb0f24bd380c8f696b390cf2e0ed\n    Update WebRTC code version (2026-07-01T04:10:12).\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I15bd8042637609a99038599e4ddd26a94def5b51\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/487061\n    Bot-Commit: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48129}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/version.cc"], "git_node": "7454ce44f1327e82475f35e08d87fef3cb73a77b", "git_parents": ["668f7c402699305680398d289c145b44eda8c775"], "node": "22e720f50eae30cac9705ca646d8cc780f67457b", "parents": ["f81293428ba5bd0d1de3894a332d56668d2cd699"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 3476959983\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/3476959983a90a28999348a1531a8992e3582ddd\n    sdk: expose RTCCertificate.getFingerprints() on iOS\n\n    described in\n      https://w3c.github.io/webrtc-pc/#dom-rtccertificate-getfingerprints\n\n    based on\n      https://github.com/threema-ch/webrtc-build-docker/blob/master/patches/expose-certificate-fingerprint.patch\n\n    Co-Authored-by: lgr@threema.ch\n    Bug: webrtc:528992529\n    Change-Id: Ic4463f33248acd53480de807f2edc8503868cb37\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/486620\n    Commit-Queue: K\u00e1ri Helgason \u003ckthelgason@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: K\u00e1ri Helgason \u003ckthelgason@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48130}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0055.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0092.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0095.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/objc/api/peerconnection/RTCCertificate.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/objc/api/peerconnection/RTCCertificate.mm", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/objc/api/peerconnection/RTCDtlsFingerprint.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/objc/api/peerconnection/RTCDtlsFingerprint.mm", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/objc/unittests/RTCCertificateTest.mm"], "git_node": "476892649a9b3db5cf132b3195f80a7932b35e0d", "git_parents": ["7454ce44f1327e82475f35e08d87fef3cb73a77b"], "node": "8357b8cc7dc5e5fb7b4d7ce84b238abfbc86cdb2", "parents": ["22e720f50eae30cac9705ca646d8cc780f67457b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 55cc86c575\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/55cc86c575a78cb683a72545cd10d089e9126169\n    Reset prior ChannelSendFrameTransformerDelegate on re-assignment\n\n    When setting a frame transformer on ChannelSend via\n    InitFrameTransformerDelegate, any existing frame_transformer_delegate_\n    was overwritten without calling Reset() on the prior delegate.\n\n    The orphaned delegate remained registered with its transformer and\n    retained a callback lambda capturing a raw ChannelSend pointer. Upon\n    destruction of ChannelSend, only the active delegate was reset,\n    leaving the orphaned delegate with a dangling pointer that could be\n    invoked post-teardown.\n\n    This change calls Reset() on any existing frame_transformer_delegate_\n    before replacing it with a new delegate, unregistering the old\n    delegate and disarming its callback lambda.\n\n    Bug: b:510386389\n    Change-Id: Ib0cf86c129280551daaeea3fcd5c08b9c5172b1b\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/487001\n    Reviewed-by: Per \u00c5hgren \u003cpeah@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Jakob Ivarsson\u200e \u003cjakobi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Per \u00c5hgren \u003cpeah@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48131}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/audio/channel_send.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/audio/channel_send_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0029.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0070.patch"], "git_node": "3fab9a21295ff156dd6751af4854eb450d4c35da", "git_parents": ["476892649a9b3db5cf132b3195f80a7932b35e0d"], "node": "40e8a8322e7d732861e19f2f65cd832d5323220e", "parents": ["8357b8cc7dc5e5fb7b4d7ce84b238abfbc86cdb2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 35154548cb\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/35154548cbe1ca4abd9fb1245d1a3607405673e5\n    Validate per-channel buffer sizes when parsing debug dumps\n\n    Ensure frame byte sizes are checked for all channels when replaying stream\n    and reverse stream events in DebugDumpReplayer and test utilities.\n    Previously, the validation check only verified channel 0 against expected\n    stream configurations.\n\n    Bug: b:510361949\n    Change-Id: I0ae58d550aeb9c5907feb168536730125974b679\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/487020\n    Reviewed-by: Jesus de Vicente Pena \u003cdevicentepena@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Per \u00c5hgren \u003cpeah@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48132}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_processing/test/aec_dump_based_simulator.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_processing/test/debug_dump_replayer.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_processing/test/debug_dump_test.cc"], "git_node": "75a89edb200dde44e959fee0c311de38c8fdbd7d", "git_parents": ["3fab9a21295ff156dd6751af4854eb450d4c35da"], "node": "2e1157af75646f1a5e921777b3e3c3095072b8d3", "parents": ["40e8a8322e7d732861e19f2f65cd832d5323220e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from f0bdc9059a\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/f0bdc9059aada7327945954c2b2050bdd3e41d37\n    sdp munging: detect removal of ice-options\n\n    vs modification. This is currently (for reasons that are not clear, this\n    removal is not affecting the code) one of the biggest contributors. It shows as \"trickle ice removed\" but what is actually removed is the ice-options line itself.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:414284082\n    Change-Id: If280e0691058291bfb05479f4c8fb6f84d68fbfb\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/485280\n    Reviewed-by: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Philipp Hancke \u003cphilipp.hancke@googlemail.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Guido Urdaneta \u003cguidou@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48133}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/uma_metrics.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/sdp_munging_detector.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/sdp_munging_detector_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "fd95341ee8201f2901c17c640e5c23a5aab3dcd1", "git_parents": ["75a89edb200dde44e