/libyuv: https://chromium.googlesource.com/libyuv/libyuv.git/+log/d23308a2a7..8e8139a504\n    * src/third_party/perfetto: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/github.com/google/perfetto.git/+log/687a8b10df..72997b8161\n    * src/tools: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/tools/+log/2d817f26dd..0f274185b0\n    DEPS diff: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/2634c7af4f..0684228bad/DEPS\n\n    BUG=None\n\n    Change-Id: If698306c5b3fbfeb13b57371236bb6c10eca3359\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/487280\n    Bot-Commit: chromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cchromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: chromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cchromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48141}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/DEPS", "third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor"], "git_node": "163071a6becf2839cedaaf9ff5769895fb1b5b3e", "git_parents": ["7200dd7f9079e9c0bb665e5eec358f414192d845"], "node": "df2c7c5bd79070ddb07f59e927c0b758409d4ab7", "parents": ["831a1f717e4d584ccd1cf1d50f4a3f836bf15394"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 6d27629e9d\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/6d27629e9d89627bc5643d6390e9c59efd3d12a1\n    Update WebRTC code version (2026-07-02T04:06:35).\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I2d1adbf2c232f957c9b151f5e4bc8d1aeba97ad7\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/487300\n    Bot-Commit: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: re