04c67da82b264cc8f72f75e4e641f35ebc"], "node": "bbb49f05f833a65c9caafc7933d6dca42b846c0f", "parents": ["7a50ab0ee9127c80f3a65ae3e1257f2891ea11db"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 526e228d25\n\n(skip-generation)\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/526e228d25f83b1023760d3835f33d622c7b9f5f\n    ML residual echo estimation: support delayed initialization\n\n    This adds a new constructor CreateNeuralResidualEchoEstimatorAsync which loads the model and inference data on a background thread.\n\n    This removes the latency of TFLite allocation / construction from the setup path of clients (e.g., getUserMedia in Chromium).\n\n    No-Iwyu: Not changing the tflite includes.\n    Bug: webrtc:442444736\n    Change-Id: I34f984567862eb6cae36f7df62a1f88a38c2a0b1\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/489580\n    Commit-Queue: Sam Zackrisson \u003csaza@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Lionel Koenig \u003clionelk@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48197}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/audio/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/audio/DEPS", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/audio/neural_residual_echo_estimator.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/audio/neural_residual_echo_estimator_creator.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/audio/neural_residual_echo_estimator_creator.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/audio/tflite_model_handle.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_processing/aec3/echo_canceller3_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_processing/aec3/neural_residual_echo_estimator/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_processing/aec3/neural_residual_echo_estimator/neural_residual_echo_estimator_impl.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_processing/aec3/neural_residual_echo_estimator/neural_residual_echo_estimator_impl.h", "third_p