https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/16a33893cb1cea3b6330d25eb28dca213ce68240\n    Add //build_overrides/crubit.gni\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I889d65c06a73512d7e8269a1711202429d4f7a5f\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/490360\n    Commit-Queue: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48206}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor"], "git_node": "3004efdd89e9edeffbee8d47e1df6bfa82ab9c02", "git_parents": ["347df3721b1f113a4ae227d4c9683d27c5932a16"], "node": "8bf447653e16883e7df67275b417874e0ca0e01b", "parents": ["0fd92c259cedd7619b518f58f55fce9101008fc4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from cf36666041\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/cf366660411457f190cff8ba829454df0713de4e\n    ssl: move OpenSSLAdapter::SSLInfoCallback to openssl_ut\u0456lity.h\n\n    removing the need for a friend relationship between the classes.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:339300437\n    Change-Id: I7572420586857b527ea2dbd5c3637b96afc78398\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/488441\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Philipp Hancke \u003cphilipp.hancke@googlemail.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Guido Urdaneta \u003cguidou@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48207}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/openssl_adapter.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/openssl_adapter.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/openssl_stream_adapter.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/openssl_utility.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/openssl_utility.h"], "git_node": "63aa81381908389f67997d4c68af2240fbf0196d", "git_parents": ["3004efdd89e9edeffbee8d47e1df6bfa82ab9c02"], "node": "583d741e68789e53f6840ac90e37cc3b3f99cac0", "parents": ["8bf447653e16883e7df67275b417874e0ca0e01b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from e3000c8732\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/e3000c87329bf7cfe1f345bf566c482a402d0d62\n    Remove InvokeWithoutArgs.\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I5e97e48eddea062512556650e00a27eab505312b\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/490382\n    Reviewed-by: Artem Titov \u003ctitovartem@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Owners-Override: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48208}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/audio_rtp_receiver_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_factory_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "859b89c3bea82db5ef05f463418a2435b7891fbe", "git_parents": ["63aa81381908389f67997d4c68af2240fbf0196d"], "node": "75d7ac0aa60d469a650d94c08f11404468710b9c", "parents": ["583d741e68789e53f6840ac90e37cc3b3f99cac0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 39f0bf89bb\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/39f0bf89bb5cb0f61cfd6e41b54c9eda756669e1\n    Always report pacer queue size in ProcessInterval\n\n    Remove add_pacing_to_cwin_ member from RtpTransportControllerSend\n    and populate msg.pacer_queue in ProcessInterval unconditionally.\n\n    Safety justification:\n    1. ProcessInterval::pacer_queue is an std::optional\u003cDataSize\u003e.\n    2. For GoogCC, CongestionWindowPushbackController already checks the\n       \"WebRTC-AddPacingToCongestionWindowPushback\" field trial internally.\n       If the trial is disabled (default), pacing_bytes_ is ignored during\n       fill_ratio calculation.\n    3. Therefore, unconditionally populating msg.pacer_queue has no effect on\n       GoogCC behavior when the trial is disabled, but allows other network\n       controllers (e.g. SCReAM) to receive and inspect pacer queue metrics.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:447037083\n    Change-Id: I8f70181d1b263b56d09eb7143e494a582e5c831f\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/490441\n    Commit-Queue: Per Kjellander \u003cperkj@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Erik Spr\u00e5ng \u003csprang@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48209}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/rtp_transport_controller_send.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/rtp_transport_controller_send.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0123.patch"], "git_node": "5cabaca28d96a0ca3680d8e629b35be08e8e0044", "git_parents": ["859b89c3bea82db5ef05f463418a2435b7891fbe"], "node": "77c51f38b32251fb1cfabed8c25e16d8ec909e5b", "parents": ["75d7ac0aa60d469a650d94c08f11404468710b9c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from ea0f85f6fd\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/ea0f85f6fd0ebb2e92f0ce29099a8ad946c68c5c\n    Update WebRTC code version (2026-07-22T04:09:46).\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: Iaf1fff81896824029157183b77ef0cb5861579d9\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/490540\n    Commit-Queue: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Bot-Commit: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48210}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/version.cc"], "git_node": "1583d5e54f81479e9ac8369c46c9298e9871b716", "git_parents": ["5cabaca28d96a0ca3680d8e629b35be08e8e0044"], "node": "8b805b043b27b7daeaa956c26209bfddcdaaafe9", "parents": ["77c51f38b32251fb1cfabed8c25e16d8ec909e5b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 47f9a96416\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/47f9a9641699cf31879d81769e998edbc0caa782\n    Make WebRTC-Video-CalculatePsnr default on with 1s interval.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:388070060\n    Change-Id: Iaa8fa8b3b62f652b8ce077950b0211314c4dc2da\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/490480\n    Reviewed-by: Per Kjellander \u003cperkj@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Erik Spr\u00e5ng \u003csprang@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Per Kjellander \u003cperkj@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48211}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtc_stats_integrationtest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/experiments/psnr_experiment.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/experiments/psnr_experiment_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "8ea4b5b255177ad47a0dbe8a23e23b0334f44924", "git_parents": ["1583d5e54f81479e9ac8369c46c9298e9871b716"], "node": "7eeeb588656d187cd37de093df79fe19a9b535ae", "parents": ["8b805b043b27b7daeaa956c26209bfddcdaaafe9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from c40855e42d\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/c40855e42dc76820c768a02ed273535e12dca190\n    Add DEFINE_JNI() to WebRTC open source\n\n    We have added some new features to JNI Zero that requires all C++\n    implementation files to have a macro call DEFINE_JNI(JavaClassName)\n    at the end of the file, where JavaClassName is the name of the Java\n    class whose generated JNI Zero header file is included in the C++ file.\n    This CL adds this macro call to the end of all C++ files.\n\n    Bug: chromium:481689330\n    Change-Id: I50abcdc0f1fe8cba20377b07577e8821d8cf9221\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/489720\n    Reviewed-by: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Martin Kong \u003cmartinkong@google.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48212}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_tools/network_tester/jni.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/android/native_test_launcher.cc"], "git_node": "11127d98aea73339e4f9d8a267cb31bd55359285", "git_parents": ["8ea4b5b255177ad47a0dbe8a23e23b0334f44924"], "node": "8f4aeb73731abc0db16c78c6923a0b4c1be0c983", "parents": ["7eeeb588656d187cd37de093df79fe19a9b535ae"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 95f38a4381\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/95f38a43815b62d4d99f0be97bf2e1a1adc20cc8\n    Update WebRTC code version (2026-07-23T04:06:57).\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I65fbd5d99b3f7234259e25ef2d4e01424fe22ef2\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/490720\n    Commit-Queue: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Bot-Commit: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48213}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/version.cc"], "git_node": "73bb6f812cb46936f9f676027a66aee8b5650373", "git_parents": ["11127d98aea73339e4f9d8a267cb31bd55359285"], "node": "fb25b70744ed065fb62ba1f84bd9feb1120d36cc", "parents": ["8f4aeb73731abc0db16c78c6923a0b4c1be0c983"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 190a760632\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/190a7606321b53c861142f97fc39f679b295f31c\n    Limit size of a video frame when packetizing it\n\n    To avoid various corner cases when frame is too large.\n    Such large frames are impractical for RTP.\n\n    Add a throttled log when a video frame is dropped by a packetizer.\n\n    Bug: chromium:503013378\n    Change-Id: Ie8c55d7c3976f0cf7420163e30e4f95f21a8b3d2\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/490600\n    Reviewed-by: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48214}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_format.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_format.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_format_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_sender_video.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_sender_video.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0121.patch"], "git_node": "3855f0c6f1c6c1ae413bbcbaf648cc007bee1935", "git_parents": ["73bb6f812cb46936f9f676027a66aee8b5650373"], "node": "4aab7168650544b247b179fc0df0bcc047a924fa", "parents": ["fb25b70744ed065fb62ba1f84bd9feb1120d36cc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 26962a77dd\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/26962a77dd14913cbb47dab7166b66501639cb93\n    Make DtlsTransport disconnect from IceTransport in destructor\n\n   