7c5bf5f0d911676d4e75ea8ff0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 5ecea90550\n\nWe cherry-picked this in bug 2053579\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/5ecea90550816628fa124e7cf55f4cdbc5aa4a7e\n    In PacketBuffer use helper to find packet slot in the buffer\n\n    This is a preparation for using unwrapped int64_t instead of wrapped\n    uint16_t RTP sequence number in PacketBuffer. Using modular works when\n    sequence number is unsigned but produces incorrect result when signed\n    sequence number happens to be negative.\n\n    Bug: chromium:537233963\n    Change-Id: I515cb7441d052a2823eee4891bb4e17b254d602f\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/491920\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Ilya Nikolaevskiy \u003cilnik@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48231}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/5ecea90550.no-op-cherry-pick-msg", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0001.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0002.patch"], "git_node": "d0752d2cfc25dc67aee1ec713274bbe2108750a1", "git_parents": ["d237ce425a6eb25c4844286cb668a77a9ba0c663"], "node": "7059073b3ea55b7e0fb34291e6866aec261788db", "parents": ["38fa25d6215187d56c8ca0f67595b356b6c2a457"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 6395da1ed7\n\nWe cherry-picked this in bug 2053579\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/6395da1ed7da9f3a8d97475c4e8db722d9415e6f\n    Use unwrappred RTP sequence numbers in PacketBuffer\n\n    Thus avoid brittle DescendingSeqNumComp\u003cuint16_t\u003e as comparator in set.\n    Such comparator lacks some properties like transitivity making it\n    dangerous to use with the std::set\n\n    Bug: chromium:537233963\n    Change-Id: I400b423ab3f0d557219d459752e00d211fd97450\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/491041\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Ilya Nikolaevskiy \u003cilnik@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48232}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/6395da1ed7.no-op-cherry-pick-msg", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0001.patch"], "git_node": "55a7c0b083197a21dc7a00adb70bda4db0002cff", "git_parents": ["d0752d2cfc25dc67aee1ec713274bbe2108750a1"], "node": "979c8ffb6d38b04f90d4e78ad2c44fb27dd05dcd", "parents": ["7059073b3ea55b7e0fb34291e6866aec261788db"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 4c1bdface8\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/4c1bdface8d17472333485e588be6028c639665a\n    Add zstd as a build dependency.\n\n    It is required by Perfetto's GN configs.\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: Ifec6a9b15e84937a4d007a240c081e5748ecfe1f\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/491940\n    Reviewed-by: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48233}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/DEPS", "third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor"], "git_node": "eaf813322aa3a55c3e93de3fde0b5518d4d59d0d", "git_parents": ["55a7c0b083197a21dc7a00adb70bda4db0002cff"], "node": "4a3be36722ed7cca4484a43e87d1aecafb1fc405", "parents": ["979c8ffb6d38b04f90d4e78ad2c44fb27dd05dcd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 6673ac14b3\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/6673ac14b3eaa09dbfe09798d3696c9222961b5e\n    Fix saturated_cast double to int64_t conversion near overflow\n\n    When converting double values near int64_t::max() (e.g. 2^63 - 8),\n    std::numeric_limits\u003cint64_t\u003e::max() cast to double rounds up to 2^63.\n    This causes the upper bound check to falsely succeed, leading to\n    undefined behavior or negative results upon conversion.\n\n    This is fixed by using PowerOfTwo to perform exact boundary checks\n    for floating-point sources.\n\n    Fixed: webrtc:42220971\n    Change-Id: I70e455566a6e3d6999f77ab31f3675435f542714\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/491740\n    Reviewed-by: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48234}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0001.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0053.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0084.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0086.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0087.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0095.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0100.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/numerics/safe_conversions_impl.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/numerics/safe_conversions_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "79c0eba362761e24aa9b12f3bfe19d5b0726ca31", "git_parents": ["eaf813322aa3a55c3e93de3fde0b5518d4d59d0d"], "node": "175ecf6d8f4ec22a4b1dd4051c0a19a96b280b3f", "parents": ["4a3be36722ed7cca4484a43e87d1aecafb1fc405"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - Vendor libwebrtc from 6f37672d35\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/6f37672d358475cd17544121a12494da454d85fb\n    Detect Tailscale interfaces as VPN\n\n    Tailscale uses tailscale\u003cindex\u003e on Linux, which GetAdapterTypeFromName\n    did not match, so the tunnel was reported as ADAPTER_TYPE_UNKNOWN. On\n    macOS and iOS it uses utun\u003cindex\u003e and was already detected, so the same\n    tunnel was classified differently depending on the platform.\n\n    See also\n      https://github.com/tailscale/tailscale/blob/cd34d441be2f277221e81672125f73ec3e8cb16d/cmd/tailscaled/tailscaled.go#L71\n\n    Bug: chromium:474435503\n    Change-Id: I5ac3c7d00891ad74a640c3b74443095e82ac13f0\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/491340\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Fredrik Solenberg \u003csolenberg@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Philipp Hancke \u003cphilipp.hancke@googlemail.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48235}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/network.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/network_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "3bf67c0019887fdeb133bd2bab554a29a575747e", "git_parents": ["79c0eba362761e24aa9b12f3bfe19d5b0726ca31"], "node": "4ff5a49f5de3bb3e1f58fe0521815c06c56716be", "parents": ["175ecf6d8f4ec22a4b1dd4051c0a19a96b280b3f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058693 - updated libwebrtc patch stack\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0144.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0145.patch"], "git_node": "dd2579cb6e7f1761a27ce64fb84d92c61d85c27f", "git_parents": ["3bf67c0019887fdeb133bd2bab554a29a575747e"], "node": "23e1f148280c992651d7a6b5c9db9c4aa7ccb620", "parents": ["4ff5a49f5de3bb3e1f58fe0521815c06c56716be"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786747193, "git_changesets": ["54c1860efd095cb4c741cee1afcd67ed966a2f4f", "b401d5a32fe5b848e3e1281a940d24774cbc842f", "e06ee264912fccdd8388dbe2bc643548f3094373", "76f83ffa2e131f47dfc8367bfd9d773