tted by ktfmt. Most of the changes in this patch are because detekt baseline didn't recognize the new formatting of ktfmt - extra spaces, newlines, longer methods etc.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314386\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/config/detekt-baseline.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/config/detekt-baseline.xml"], "git_node": "8825237d2598736cd0dfd98e46155bfbc0c5439c", "git_parents": ["1967f78d98efce2eab72c0cfc79e9319360d7b1e"], "node": "8d2b55769a1e60d13b72b6218b52840db88b0d3f", "parents": ["c63a2448da199fab89490da18d62d70660be9a4a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Aaditya Dhingra \u003cadhingra@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050591 - Format apilint plugin files with ktfmt. r=geckoview-reviewers,jonalmeida\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318743\n", "files": ["mobile/android/gradle/plugins/apilint/apilint/src/main/kotlin/org/mozilla/apilint/ApiCompatLintTask.kt", "mobile/android/gradle/plugins/apilint/apilint/src/main/kotlin/org/mozilla/apilint/ApiLintPlugin.kt", "mobile/android/gradle/plugins/apilint/apilint/src/main/kotlin/org/mozilla/apilint/ApiLintPluginExtension.kt", "mobile/android/gradle/plugins/apilint/apilint/src/main/kotlin/org/mozilla/apilint/PythonExec.kt", "mobile/android/gradle/plugins/apilint/apilint/src/test/kotlin/org/mozilla/apilint/ApiCompatLintTaskTest.kt", "mobile/android/gradle/plugins/apilint/apilint/src/test/kotlin/org/mozilla/apilint/ApiLintPluginExtensionTest.kt", "mobile/android/gradle/plugins/apilint/apilint/src/test/kotlin/org/mozilla/apilint/ApiLintPluginTest.kt", "mobile/android/gradle/plugins/apilint/apilint/src/test/kotlin/org/mozilla/apilint/ApiLintTaskInputsTest.kt", "mobile/android/gradle/plugins/apilint/apilint/src/test/kotlin/org/mozilla/apilint/PythonExecTest.kt"], "git_node": "b4f712874bb3721456c5573673ab78f33f121b42", "git_parents": ["8825237d2598736cd0dfd98e46155bfbc0c5439c"], "node": "1d723ff15ec08d364da121212bc63942bb3c113b", "parents": ["8d2b55769a1e60d13b72b6218b52840db88b0d3f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Guichard \u003cnicolas.guichard@kdab.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063622 - Early-return when Td is null in VisitTemplateSpecializationTypeLoc. r=asuth\n\nWith Clang 21, we don't reach VisitTemplateSpecializationTypeLoc when\nvisiting a dependent template name. With Clang 22 we do, but we don't\nhave enough information for getTemplateName to return an actual value.\n\nIn both cases: we never revisit this dependent location, so we do not\nemit analysis records for it. This could probably be improved but let's\njust fix the crash first.\n\nCherry-picked from https://github.com/mozsearch/mozsearch/pull/1133\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318885\n", "files": ["build/clang-plugin/mozsearch-plugin/MozsearchIndexer.cpp"], "git_node": "474a33371a7e890a936b34585e067092a30bec44", "git_parents": ["b4f712874bb3721456c5573673ab78f33f121b42"], "node": "0481d9935367a5f2d42dabe2ae128b7da8e1cb18", "parents": ["1d723ff15ec08d364da121212bc63942bb3c113b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Calixte Denizet \u003ccalixte.denizet@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063815 - Update PDF.js to new version 48bb93b89de51fe40521c2e52f8be51440283b6f r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318883\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/build/pdf.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/build/pdf.scripting.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/build/pdf.worker.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/debugger.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/images/toolbarButton-menuArrowNova.svg", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/standard_fonts/LICENSE_LIBERATION", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/viewer-geckoview.css", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/viewer-geckoview.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/viewer.css", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/viewer.mjs", "t