ionContextMenu/_SectionContextMenu.scss", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/DiscoveryStreamComponents/SectionContextMenu.test.jsx"], "git_node": "e77e5cad2b7ae6cd50855af2409cadb59e919f99", "git_parents": ["ad5afd6f5e039ce096a8b69669ed2a1079658dd2"], "node": "bb56d358e4b22b31ecf6828ebea45cb859662c96", "parents": ["7fc7a529176c7385c10c109110e794748296dccf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jack Brown \u003cjbrown@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2051742 - Extract shared panel-list functions - r=maxx,ini\n\nAs I was migrating each component in the stack I noticed they were all implementing the same hide/show listeners on the panel-lists to keep track of their visibility state.\n\nThis patch extracts that common functionality into two new functions in the new file `panel-list-utils.jsx`, including a custom hook for the function components.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312182\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/DiscoveryStreamComponents/AdBannerContextMenu/AdBannerContextMenu.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/DiscoveryStreamComponents/DSLinkMenu/DSLinkMenu.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/DiscoveryStreamComponents/SectionContextMenu/SectionContextMenu.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/TopSites/TopSite.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/lib/panel-list-utils.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/karma.mc.config.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/lib/panel-list-utils.test.jsx"], "git_node": "aa2778e2e44a28d805ae05f5a119fe16af1a74a0", "git_parents": ["e77e5cad2b7ae6cd50855af2409cadb59e919f99"], "node": "a2440e78bf11d12317c9ea6ec65184a5d71d7928", "parents": ["bb56d358e4b22b31ecf6828ebea45cb859662c96"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Matthew Gregan \u003ckinetik@flim.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063776 - Update libcubeb to f0bd97db. r=cubeb-reviewers,padenot\n\nDifferent