": "default", "desc": "Bug 2039416 - Update builders to rustc 1.95. r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,sergesanspaille\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310745\n", "files": ["build/build-rust/Zprofile.patch", "taskcluster/kinds/fetch/toolchains.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/toolchain/rust.yml"], "git_node": "945d7476faedbb8185e4df0748ce0b2aafee61df", "git_parents": ["8734366d07acf10b75df7f9804edcb7c9f3a2e83"], "node": "ff06909672be214cd25860bb3c203189b7a97b7a", "parents": ["2a777fb159a5f124c02611727f3f83c0c86a10d6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh+mozilla@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1977771 - Update builders to clang 22. r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,sergesanspaille\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310746\n", "files": ["build/build-clang/clang-tidy.json", "build/moz.configure/compile-checks.configure", "taskcluster/kinds/toolchain/clang-tidy.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/toolchain/clang.yml", "tools/clang-tidy/config.yaml", "tools/clang-tidy/test/performance-unnecessary-copy-initialization.json"], "git_node": "175f50f352a89b2502b09c0364d9011f6f6c1354", "git_parents": ["945d7476faedbb8185e4df0748ce0b2aafee61df"], "node": "0d975b238e7ec55c4ac4776afcd9318d3134cc68", "parents": ["ff06909672be214cd25860bb3c203189b7a97b7a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "rperta \u003crperta@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2052268, Bug 2052263, Bug 2052265 - Toggle share panel button visibility depending on the url. r=jprickett\" for causing bc failures at browser_testSharePanelButtonVisibility.js\n\nThis reverts commit e707ac311a178433076e4f953b049f09f563c9d6.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2052263 - Add windows sharing functionality to share panel. r=jprickett\"\n\nThis reverts commit a1d03e82e8944828f4b45301705534a32a2cd9ae.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2052265 - Add QR code button to share panel. r=jprickett\"\n\nThis reverts commit 4eb65f802a63552142329f37723802aa09cf014a.\n", "files": ["browser/components/sharing/SharePageAction.sys.mjs", "browser/components/sharing/SharingUtils.sys.mjs", "browser/components/sharing/tests/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/sharing/tests/browser/browser_testSharePanelButtonVisibility.js", "browser/components/sharing/tests/browser/browser_testSharePanelQRCode.js", "browser/components/sharing/tests/browser/browser_testSharePanelWindowsShare.js"], "git_node": "072be41a33306faab362e57b67ceb5c7c38266b5", "git_parents": ["175f50f352a89b2502b09c0364d9011f6f6c1354"], "node": "1f456cca5f583ec0b4b81effa500487c0bfdbd50", "parents": ["0d975b238e7ec55c4ac4776afcd9318d3134cc68"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063377 - Restore quarter-pixel glyph positioning for rotated and skewed text r=gfx-reviewers,aosmond\n\nBug 2005426 removed SubpixelDirection::Mixed, so rotated and skewed runs fell\nthrough to None and each glyph rounded its pen to a whole device pixel\nindependently. Under a transform that changes slightly each frame, the letters\nof a word pop a pixel at a time.\n\nReinstate Mixed: both axes carry a quarter-pixel offset. The 16 variants pack\ninto one atlas entry selected in the shader, so a glyph costs one texture cache\nentry at 16 times the width rather than 16 entries.\n\nThe new reftest asserts that two rotated runs a quarter of a pixel apart render\ndifferently, which whole-pixel rounding cannot satisfy. References regenerated.\nThree fuzz counts go up slightly: the new sub-pixel positions leave a few more\npixels sitting on an anti-aliasing boundary, each differing by at most one level.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319300\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/res/prim_shared.glsl", "gfx/wr/webrender/res/ps_text_run.glsl", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/batch.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/text_run.rs", "gfx/wr/wr_glyph_rasterizer/src/rasterizer.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/text/alpha-transform.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/text/clipped-transform.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/text/raster-space.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/text/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/text/rotated-subpixel-position-notref.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/text/rotated-subpixel-position.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/text/shadow-transforms.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/text/subpixel-rotate.png"], "git_node": "f9eecdfcaa0411cfb516a33e588649282057073a", "git_parents": ["072be41a33306faab362e57b67ceb5c7c38266b5"], "node": "3f50d4c04fb08299ffaa5d9a831550364cb9d09b", "parents": ["1f456cca5f583ec0b4b81effa500487c0bfdbd50"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lando \u003clando@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Merge autoland to mozilla-central\n", "files": ["browser/components/tabbrowser/content/tabbrowser.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/DiscoveryStreamComponents/BriefingCard/BriefingCard.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/DiscoveryStreamComponents/BriefingCard/_BriefingCard.scss", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/DiscoveryStreamComponents/BriefingCard.test.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/unit/content-src/components/DiscoveryStreamComponents/BriefingCard/BriefingCard.test.jsx", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/1898935-mysunlife.sunlife.com.hk.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/1930440-online.singaporepools.com.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/1941530-climate.rutgers.edu.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/2008115-pge.com.json", "gfx/angle/patches/0009-D3D11-Avoid-cache-self-eviction-for-uniform-buffers.patch", "gfx/angle/patches/0010-D3D11-Fix-potential-OOB-read-in-StoreStaticAttrib.patch", "gfx/angle/patches/0011-call-SafeDelete-only-if-onDestroy-has-not-errored.patch", "gfx/angle/patches/0012-use-correct-framebuffer-var.patch", "gfx/angle/patches/0013-eliminate-static_cast.patch", "gfx