378ffd188aad6e571666ebac"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jonathan Moss \u003cjmoss@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2019745 - Skip test_BHRObserver.js on Windows 11 25H2. r=aryx\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319803\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/backgroundhangmonitor/tests/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "3aeedceaf111d11ba2afb4d08f76c692c1b170a1", "git_parents": ["f4b188fc79745ed1ce6cd5a1f5abbabd8f36f74d"], "node": "1282f1f76c0a62e81009ab5ce7ec9ef718a76d50", "parents": ["318b566d4691acef47399a618ccbb6d0e60664d7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Markus Stange \u003cmstange.moz@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064515 - Fix method matching for 'IDBObjectStore.delete'. r=perftest-reviewers,kshampur\n\nThis also fixes `IDBCursor.continue` and `console.assert`.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319615\n", "files": ["testing/raptor/raptor/browser_function_labels.toml"], "git_node": "38230442eb92c67ebce260788f7c752b8a4af52a", "git_parents": ["3aeedceaf111d11ba2afb4d08f76c692c1b170a1"], "node": "0384944cddf428c7f17cd0f6f061931bad0e5330", "parents": ["1282f1f76c0a62e81009ab5ce7ec9ef718a76d50"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephen Thompson \u003csthompson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057533 - browser_aboutRestartRequired should always skip Linux ccov r=tabbrowser-reviewers,niklas\n\nTry runs with Linux 24.04 code coverage builds show that browser_aboutRestartRequired_buildid_false-positive.js fails consistently. There is a timeout in test_telemetry_restartrequired_falsepositive_mismatch waiting on the `oop-browser-crashed` message. This fails whether or not the Nova redesign is enabled. Given that all of the tests in this suite are skipped on Windows ccov builds, I think it's reasonable to skip on Linux ccov as well.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319580\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/test/tabcrashed/browser_abo