ettingsPrivateBrowsingSelectors.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/tests/SettingsPrivateBrowsingTest.kt"], "git_node": "f1d6bc5cad07dc2ba350c1822c36a34f322afc84", "git_parents": ["860e0b76a2a3861497a1194c4d093051151027c1"], "node": "44f0bb97a9dcc3a59e6681047aca21ec54de1fe9", "parents": ["19f4efe8376fb7c44f3983f4af2921728ffaa976"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Krist Baliev \u003ckbaliev@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2043523 - Left and right arrow keys move focus between popup notification footer buttons. r=mkennedy,mtigley\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318457\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/test/popupNotifications/browser_popupNotification_keyboard.js", "toolkit/content/widgets/popupnotification.js"], "git_node": "3ffc2ab968d7c1445cf76c71551625f04d4dda08", "git_parents": ["f1d6bc5cad07dc2ba350c1822c36a34f322afc84"], "node": "8c987bb985bb3dcc6a53683722abee766a2f90ce", "parents": ["44f0bb97a9dcc3a59e6681047aca21ec54de1fe9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sebastian Streich \u003csstreich@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063357 - Give the IP Protection auth layer a shared error vocabulary. r=ip-protection-reviewers,apopov\n\nProviders each reported failures with their own ad-hoc strings. Add AUTH_ERRORS\nand a per-backend toError(), so that a status other than 200 always resolves\nwith an error the caller can act on.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319450\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/ipprotection/IPPAuthProvider.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/enterprise/IPPEnterpriseAuthProvider.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/fxa/GuardianClient.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/fxa/IPPAndroidAuthProvider.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/fxa/IPPFxaActivateAuthProvider.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/gpi/IPPGpiAuthProvider.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/tests/xpcshell/test_GuardianClient.js"], "git_node": "2f4fb7b4372ac9644938a8830afe20d57562395d", "git_parents": ["3ffc2ab968d7c1445cf76c71551625f04d4dda08"], "node": "b739575364cf603733d66c7b45359c5fd96f4720", "parents": ["8c987bb985bb3dcc6a53683722abee766a2f90ce"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sebastian Streich \u003csstreich@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063357 - Report a specific reason for every IP Protection activation failure. r=ip-protection-reviewers,apopov\n\nFailures that resolved with a bare {started: false} now name their cause, and\nthe auth provider's error is forwarded instead of being collapsed into\nPASS_UNAVAILABLE.\n\nAlso drops the Android special case for 451, which reported a region block as a\ncatastrophic failure.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319452\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/ipprotection/IPPProxyManager.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/docs/Constants.md", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/tests/xpcshell/head.js", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/tests/xpcshell/test_IPProxyManager.js"], "git_node": "ec7aa3fd1d9fba45fe075608875e331b904b7476", "git_parents": ["2f4fb7b4372ac9644938a8830afe20d57562395d"], "node": "57dc3b3283183f2abdaa78856addfe3c2c545715", "parents": ["b739575364cf603733d66c7b45359c5fd96f4720"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sebastian Streich \u003csstreich@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063357 - Keep the IP Protection panel silent for errors it already shows. r=ip-protection-reviewers,apopov\n\nActivation now reports a reason when the proxy is paused or not ready, which\nthe panel must not turn into an error message on top of its own UI.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319453\n", "files": ["browser/components/ipprotection/IPProtectionPanel.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "ffbb412877b5de90d756eb9774139bb2a01b9baa", "git_parents": ["ec7aa3fd1d9fba45fe075608875e331b904b7476"], "node": "9c23da8ea5e57c94ca56493899e3f3d7303ea6e5", "parents": ["57dc3b3283183f2abdaa78856addfe3c2c545715"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sebastian Streich \u003csstreich@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063357 - Map IP Protection activation errors to typed GeckoView codes. r=geckoview-reviewers,android-reviewers,jonalmeida\n\nCauses the proxy could not name, and every deactivate() and refreshUsage()\nfailure, arrived as ERROR_UNKNOWN. Add a code per cause and route all three\nqueries through the same mapper.\n\napi.txt is regenerated by ./mach gradle :geckoview:apiUpdateFileDebug.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319455\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/engine-gecko/src/main/java/mozilla/components/browser/engine/gecko/ipprotection/GeckoIPProtectionHandler.kt", "mobile/android/geckoview/api.txt", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/test/IPProtectionControllerTest.kt", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/IPProtectionController.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/doc-files/CHANGELOG.md"], "git_node": "7874e705a6163aeec0d406f924014b5845dde8ae", "git_parents": ["ffbb412877b5de90d756eb9774139bb2a01b9baa"], "node": "b88504914c4a6b46a30a39b93f88fd8fbdd052d8", "parents": ["9c23da8ea5e57c94ca56493899e3f3d7303ea6e5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Kaply \u003cmozilla@kaply.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063975 - Hide the File menu New Private Window item when private browsing is disabled. r=emilio\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319210\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/browser-init.js", "browser/base/content/nonbrowser-mac.js", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/browser/browser_policy_disable_privatebrowsing.js"], "git_node": "cb7f9b6d22e11c071a93d4b7a124d02d507a5af4", "git_parents": ["7874e705a6163aeec0d406f924014b5845dde8ae"], "node": "99665606d49d064f66a68477b6c3573da2e