6b7e0bbcdce54b0516ae37e10e31b9e1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Updatebot \u003cupdatebot@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056432 - Apply mozilla patches for googletest r=ahal\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313127\n", "files": ["third_party/googletest/googletest/include/gtest/gtest.h"], "git_node": "035207508158e740641f89eb1247566cedc1cb1e", "git_parents": ["4e097829297ab431dad58dc2435e4ad5fb93a856"], "node": "6da2394d26f4cde18f80d093797a87b5b8d7dd44", "parents": ["292a46fb097e85350dbd348a925649be1e5b0689"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nikki Sharpley \u003cnsharpley@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064519 - Restore Sign Out button in app menu to below sync status r=sclements\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319622\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/browser-sync.js", "browser/base/content/test/sync/browser_sync.js"], "git_node": "14d104ab834f30c57fde8d905cec1a8e3ef7a97d", "git_parents": ["035207508158e740641f89eb1247566cedc1cb1e"], "node": "daac3b41cc1eebf68a08ff1305a69192ec6de16d", "parents": ["6da2394d26f4cde18f80d093797a87b5b8d7dd44"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Striemer \u003cmstriemer@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1861496 - Update Lit patches to lit@3.3.3 r=tgiles\n\nThe bundle-lit.sh script stopped working when we moved to git since it\nused `git patch`, this was now making the paths relative to the firefox\nsource root. It now moves the clone into a temp directory, makes that a\ngit repository and patches it. We could probably do this inline, but\nrunning `git init` in your firefox directory seemed like it could cause\nunwanted side effects if something goes wrong.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D192008\n", "files": ["toolkit/content/vendor/lit/0001-disable-terser-step.patch", "toolkit/content/vendor/lit/0002-use-DOMParser-not-innerHTML.patch", "toolkit/content/vendor/lit/0003-Disable-source-maps.patch", "toolkit/content/vendor/lit/0004-Remove-the-bundled-warning.patch", "toolkit/content/vendor/lit/0005-Bug-1808741-Do-not-set-style-attributes-when-using-s.patch", "toolkit/content/vendor/lit/README.md", "toolkit/content/vendor/lit/bundle-lit.sh"], "git_node": "b4209c503f37af8a951767ee7a979889ebbf5f07", "git_parents": ["14d104ab834f30c57fde8d905cec1a8e3ef7a97d"], "node": "b96b99d1d54668a2d939cf654d5e93b8450ae969", "parents": ["daac3b41cc1eebf68a08ff1305a69192ec6de16d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Striemer \u003cmstriemer@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1861496 - Update Lit to lit@3.3.3 r=tgiles,Standard8\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D192009\n", "files": ["package-lock.json", "package.json", "toolkit/content/vendor/lit/moz.yaml", "toolkit/content/widgets/vendor/lit.all.mjs"], "git_node": "629f848e6f1f9f9676a3a940cb22b9a342cb34b5", "git_parents": ["b4209c503f37af8a951767ee7a979889ebbf5f07"], "node": "7a0591c27a7fa5f7acd13bb6dd2e12deff635b17", "parents": ["b96b99d1d54668a2d939cf654d5e93b8450ae969"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Striemer \u003cmstriemer@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1861496 - Fixes for Lit upgrade r=tabbrowser-reviewers,tgiles,nsharpley\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319226\n", "files": ["browser/components/preferences/tests/search/browser_searchChangedEngine.js", "browser/components/preferences/tests/search/browser_search_userEngineDialog.js", "browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser_tab_groups_tab_interactions_telemetry.js", "browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser_tab_splitview_about_opentabs.js"], "git_node": "10c67792b86484b601301d8b24c7a6a34d49a85a", "git_parents": ["629f848e6f1f9f9676a3a940cb22b9a342cb34b5"], "node": "fe8f9d1264fdc4a1965f7af5d6acd7296716edf5", "parents": ["7a0591c27a7fa5f7acd13bb6dd2e12deff635b17"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Caleb Chan \u003ccachan@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1897231 - Split the preference into two for recording when a search engine was blocked. r=Standard8\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317835\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/search/SearchService.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/search/tests/xpcshell/test_ignorelist.js"], "git_node": "b5c6357dc90d8469ecd94e788aac34f3b468c585", "git_parents": ["10c67792b86484b601301d8b24c7a6a34d49a85a"], "node": "d44b35a97777902e6820846716240d48774d9ba6", "parents": ["fe8f9d1264fdc4a1965f7af5d6acd7296716edf5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nick Alexander \u003cnalexander@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1782157 - Add docs for Windows native notifications with new `notificationserver.dll`. r=aborondo,iholmes,hsohaney,saschanaz\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D153138\n", "files": ["toolkit/mozapps/notificationserver/docs/index.md", "toolkit/mozapps/notificationserver/moz.build", "widget/windows/docs/index.md"], "git_node": "0856a27e204712f29368d9d3ab30af46a1beffdb", "git_parents": ["b5c6357dc90d8469ecd94e788aac34f3b468c585"], "node": "06bf28f0f1f4fa2e3056e91adb93c1cfe1a25206", "parents": ["d44b35a97777902e6820846716240d48774d9ba6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicholas Poon \u003cnpoon@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064507 - When all active normal tabs are selected for deletion, don't remove inactive tabs r=android-reviewers,007\n\nwillTabsRemainAfterDeletion does not include inactive tabs but the deletion branch that happens due to the function evaluating to false also deletes inactive tabs. Also, note that deleteMultipleTabs now calls removeTabs instead of removeNormalTabs when no active normal tabs remain. This results in tab group assignments being deleted instead of tab groups being closed and tab group assignments are kept, as seen in TabGroupMiddleware.kt. This can be dealt with in a follow up\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319837\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/HomeScreenViewModel.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/TabsCleanupFeature.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabstray/controller/TabManagerController.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/TabsCleanupFeatureTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabstray/controller/DefaultTabManagerControllerTest.kt"], "git_node": "ffc5f075fe471e8b88b1f3a936d255a5b9ec1dba", "git_parents": ["0856a27e204712f29368d9d3ab30af46a1beffdb"], "node": "6bf2e70d3fd0f0798297401d89e455a6ff26e247", "parents": ["06bf28f0f1f4fa2e3056e91adb93c1cfe1a25206"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Bryan Johns \u003cbjohns@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2052356 - Moved getFxAToken call before engine creation; cached RS records r=tetchart,echa\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318592\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/models/Chat.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/PromptLoader.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/Utils.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/xpcshell/test_Utils_RemoteSettings.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-window/ai-window.mjs"], "git_node": "402e7c158bd62624672b607a8fd9f95e44ade7d0", "git_parents": ["ffc5f075fe471e8b88b1f3a936d255a5b9ec1dba"], "node": "cd4cfb4fc1214cd507b9eb7485c256fd2274fba2", "parents": ["6bf2e70d3fd0f0798297401d89e455a6ff26e247"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Manuel Bucher \u003cmanuel@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061799 - Derive storage access from WindowGlobalParent r=timhuang\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319576\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/antitracking/AntiTrackingUtils.cpp"], "git_node": "190161f9abcf6670cd4851ad609bea11a0ee0307", "git_parents": ["402e7c158bd62624672b607a8fd9f95e44ade7d0"], "node": "9160cfaabeda65a8c5125b8341b36404b1e295ab", "parents": ["cd4cfb4fc1214cd507b9eb7485c256fd2274fba2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Eitan Isaacson \u003ceitan@monotonous.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058652 - Don't truncate actor ID. r=Jamie\n\nMatch the type of the local actorID with the uint64 mActorID.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315425\n", "files": ["accessible/ipc/DocAccessibleParent.cpp"], "git_node": "07174ef66d5604603f43c142a33e310cfaec1f08", "git_parents": ["190161f9abcf6670cd4851ad609bea11a0ee0307"], "node": "fe4ac00d3f9649e2e7ed29b6c149d343aa88cd88", "parents": ["9160cfaabeda65a8c5125b8341b36404b1e295ab"], "tags": []}, {"author": "kpatenio \u003ckpatenio@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050745 - update overflow option icon colors to match sidebar icon colors for themes supporting --panel-icon-fill r=desktop-theme-reviewers,emilio,sclements\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317211\n", "files": ["browser/themes/addons/alpenglow/manifest.json", "browser/themes/shared/browser-colors.css", "toolkit/themes/shared/popup.css"], "git_node": "869d83d9f862c98acdd68b0b2e197f92138b60fd", "git_parents": ["07174ef66d5604603f43c142a33e310cfaec1f08"], "node": "5ca00c8e81fc945499ee0d2f82c014479ef9947e", "parents": ["fe4ac00d3f9649e2e7ed29b6c149d343aa88cd88"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sky Ning \u003csning@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062679 - Read BHR pings from the redacted hang_report view r=dthayer\n\nThe aggregation job's service account is granted on\nfirefox_desktop.hang_report, which carries far more than the job reads:\nsession id, geo, ISP, attribution, experiments, user-agent data and\nIP-derived metadata.\n\nfirefox_desktop.hang_report_redacted (DENG-11394, bigquery-etl #9778) is a\nnarrow allow-list projection of the same stable table exposing only the\ncolumns this query selects. Point the job at it so the wide grant can be\nrevoked.\n\nNo data change: the generated hang_report view is SELECT * plus derived\ncolumns (app_version_*, is_bot_generated) and filters no rows, so every\ncolumn read here is identical through either view.\n\nLanding order: the view must be deployed before this lands, and the grant on\nfirefox_desktop.hang_report is only revoked afterwards. Revoking before this\nlands would break the running cron.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318193\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/backgroundhangmonitor/aggregation/bhr_collection.py", "toolkit/components/backgroundhangmonitor/aggregation/tests/test_bhr_collection.py"], "git_node": "5faae4ff36e5157838f67b1d202019e294e816ba", "git_parents": ["869d83d9f862c98acdd68b0b2e197f92138b60fd"], "node": "34ba3cebd7a6b031137a1a407c6ab2812a1a85c2", "parents": ["5ca00c8e81fc945499ee0d2f82c014479ef9947e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Cosmin Sabou \u003ccsabou@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 1861496 - Fixes for Lit upgrade r=tabbrowser-reviewers,tgiles,nsharpley\" for causing linting failures.\n\nThis reverts commit 10c67792b86484b601301d8b24c7a6a34d49a85a.\n\nRevert \"Bug 1861496 - Update Lit to lit@3.3.3 r=tgiles,Standard8\"\n\nThis reverts commit 629f848e6f1f9f9676a3a940cb22b9a342cb34b5.\n\nRevert \"Bug 1861496 - Update Lit patches to lit@3.3.3 r=tgiles\"\n\nThis reverts commit b4209c503f37af8a951767ee7a979889ebbf5f07.\n", "files": ["browser/components/preferences/tests/search/browser_searchChangedEngine.js", "browser/components/preferences/tests/search/browser_search_userEngineDialog.js", "browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser_tab_groups_tab_interactions_telemetry.js", "browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser_tab_splitview_about_opentabs.js", "package-lock.json", "package.json", "toolkit/content/vendor/lit/0001-disable-terser-step.patch", "toolkit/content/vendor/lit/0002-use-DOMParser-not-innerHTML.patch", "toolkit/conten