au \u003cjcristau@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055837 - use taskcluster-built python for test tasks. r=taskgraph-reviewers,bhearsum\n\nThis was meant to have happened in bug 1888131.  Better late than never.\n\nKeep using system python on android-hw though, as the scripts we run\nthere rely on it.  And use 3.11 instead of the default 3.9 for windows gtests,\nbecause of\nhttps://searchfox.org/firefox-main/rev/7d438b99e58d16388e4327f2460d14ad4c8be075/browser/app/desktop-launcher/tests/gtest/DesktopLauncherDownloaderTest.cpp#38\n(3.9's http.server doesn't have --protocol,\nhttps://docs.python.org/3/library/http.server.html#cmdoption-http.server-p).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312746\n", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/test/compiled.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/test/kind.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/test/misc.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/test/xpcshell.yml"], "git_node": "413330b70ec72049f8e6d7e9c970595ba7665b23", "git_parents": ["17e93ad5d3261e20104c7f6f2ec867ecc138ca1a"], "node": "aa0ca25842a070b16f787929407028be4be4bddf", "parents": ["63679a6086f79e2a3854404b8fa4976decb02cba"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Keith Cirkel \u003ckeithamus@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064333 - Turn scoped registries on for nightly builds r=dom-core-reviewers,smaug,devtools-reviewers,ochameau\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319462\n", "files": ["devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/browser_webconsole_object_inspector_entries.snapshot.mjs", "devtools/shared/tests/objects/AllJavascriptTypes.mjs", "modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml", "testing/web-platform/meta/dom/idlharness.window.js.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/domparsing/tentative/stream-html-custom-element-sanitizer.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/dom/idlharness.https.html.ini"], "git_node": "a173c556f3e0667cf3238d5c86a2fe2f4b705f31", "git_parents": ["413330b70ec72049f8e6d7e9c970595ba7665b23"], "node": "b9d9dd337871bd9a0d1cd44b1c4248d5ec1b76e3", "parents": ["aa0ca25842a070b16f787929407028be4be4bddf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064164 - Remove obsolete Expat 01_noslop.patch. r=mccr8\n\nThe patch tuned INIT_BLOCK_SIZE so that poolGrow() allocations landed exactly on a\nmozjemalloc size class. Expat 2.7.2's CVE-2025-59375 fix routes every allocation through\nexpat_malloc(), which prepends an 8-byte header, so the request no longer lands where the\ntuning intended. It is moot regardless: expat is compiled into the wasm sandbox in all\nshipping configurations and uses dlmalloc there, which has no jemalloc-style size classes.\n\nThe remaining patches are renumbered to close the gap. Their contents are untouched, so they\napply at an offset until the hunk headers get regenerated as part of the next upstream\nupdate.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320106\n", "files": ["parser/expat/01_noslop.patch", "parser/expat/01_report_mismatched_tag.patch", "parser/expat/02_dont_generate_salt.patch", "parser/expat/02_report_mismatched_tag.patch", "parser/expat/03_always_set_eventptrs.patch", "parser/expat/03_dont_generate_salt.patch", "parser/expat/04_always_set_eventptrs.patch", "parser/expat/04_getcurrentbyteindex.patch", "parser/expat/05_always_store_rawnames.patch", "parser/expat/05_getcurrentbyteindex.patch", "parser/expat/06_always_store_rawnames.patch", "parser/expat/06_dont_ignore_undeclared_entity.patch", "parser/expat/07_dont_ignore_undeclared_entity.patch", "parser/expat/07_include_xmlns.patch", "parser/expat/08_include_xmlns.patch", "parser/expat/08_internalsubset.patch", "parser/expat/09_internalsubset.patch", "parser/expat/09_version_limit.patch", "parser/expat/10_no_debug_report.patch", "parser/expat/10_version_limit.patch", "parser/expat/11_no_debug_report.patch", "parser/expat/11_unused.patch", "parser/expat/12_high_surrogate_mask.patch", "parser/expat/12_unused.patch", "parser/expat/13_high_surrogate_mask.patch", "parser/expat/expat/lib/xmlparse.c", "parser/expat/moz.yaml"], "git_node": "3b61c51737436ecb2d5450c3d92d3cdd3307cecf", "git_parents": ["a173c556f3e0667cf3238d5c86a2fe2f4b705f31"], "node": "ada813d61c2efaa3b3724fe85903af21592c1f81", "parents": ["b9d9dd337871bd9a0d1cd44b1c4248d5ec1b76e3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrea Marchesini \u003camarchesini@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064977 - Extend glean metrics networking.cookie_db_validation to 167 r=necko-reviewers,valentin\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320100\n", "files": ["netwerk/metrics.yaml"], "git_node": "6d91d54671b61f8bec724cd7060b272df1479a71", "git_parents": ["3b61c51737436ecb2d5450c3d92d3cdd3307cecf"], "node": "85c53e159ac22240a13548ec5d178105b975f71a", "parents": ["ada813d61c2efaa3b3724fe85903af21592c1f81"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064851 - Update Gradle to version 9.7.1. r=android-reviewers,mcarare\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319909\n", "files": ["gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties", "mobile/android/android-components/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties", "mobile/android/fenix/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties", "mobile/android/focus-android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties"], "git_node": "3c03f9c11e150b989ed8e9c451aaefe1605779a7", "git_parents": ["6d91d54671b61f8bec724cd7060b272df1479a71"], "node": "6d9c16da0a93943cdf163bcde13339ad8501e35c", "parents": ["85c53e159ac22240a13548ec5d178105b975f71a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jon Coppeard \u003cjcoppeard@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065066 - Part 1: Add JS_DEFINE_UNTYPED_SLOT macro r=spidermonkey-reviewers,jandem\n\nSome slots allow any kind of Value. Adding this macro makes the slot\ndefinitions more regular and easier to read.\n\n