15114030c0366ba87f00f8a427b550deebb74", "b80cee07668abd722eccdfdaa9f73026d1f33ea7", "7860c26ecbd1f8b9b5870beee26e49e3a5f2ab05", "c0e30ee6b7d3a74774a61e1ff685cad2ef1aa72c", "a665bd538653afa035d4c4739792d67d677f0f6f", "38e9edffd0719397761062b9ed35ab558deaf93e", "0555e58c5d39c41d11fedd5d01f7f65123a921fe", "4add51867c5e7e010bb2a1c91263a4be591fa809", "ebcfd719ba5607af8f5ceefad167cbcf95b540a5", "f8837d62196cdb46402a23a3bed555c21d70d4de"], "user": "abutkovits@mozilla.com"}, "45134": {"changesets": [{"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2063759 - Avoid line-clamp style adjustment for displays that aren't block/inline. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,emilio,layout-reviewers\" for causing failures at webkit-line-clamp-016.html.\n\nThis reverts commit c0e30ee6b7d3a74774a61e1ff685cad2ef1aa72c.\n", "files": ["layout/generic/nsBlockFrame.cpp", "servo/components/style/style_adjuster.rs", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-overflow/line-clamp/webkit-line-clamp-bug-2063759-crash.html"], "git_node": "006d979732e019242073d13916eee12f0bf1982e", "git_parents": ["f8837d62196cdb46402a23a3bed555c21d70d4de"], "node": "2310ef435ce0c1d24dccd4c5cc37887a9004d86b", "parents": ["24f87c3a9e14c1f38e4176c15088d05751d63044"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Cristian Tuns \u003cctuns@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2055837 - use taskcluster-built python for web-platform-tests tasks. r=taskgraph-reviewers,bhearsum\"\n\nThis reverts commit 6c323749e63591cd33fc2d121e3c130dd0d6907f.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2055837 - use taskcluster-built python for reftest tasks. r=taskgraph-reviewers,bhearsum\"\n\nThis reverts commit 2b7c61324e7f95c1fe18db8688e3f0e1e93163a5.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2055837 - use taskcluster-built python for mochitest tasks. r=taskgraph-reviewers,bhearsum\"\n\nThis reverts commit 12415db457fc7adc6c13fda6b3ccc6a9e724b3bc.\n", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/mochitest/kind.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/reftest/kind.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/web-platform-tests/kind.yml"], "git_node": "04b29f9c2d2dbf5639c3f45ea812bb4c21dc81c6", "git_parents": ["006d979732e019242073d13916eee12f0bf1982e"], "node": "dbb1fe4e9cc4ae0f4779ce8073d7bf4b40a0e22c", "parents": ["2310ef435ce0c1d24dccd4c5cc37887a9004d86b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787262524, "git_changesets": ["006d979732e019242073d13916eee12f0bf1982e", "04b29f9c2d2dbf5639c3f45ea812bb4c21dc81c6"], "user": "abutkovits@mozilla.com"}, "45135": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jonathan Moss \u003cjmoss@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065002 - Close style editor tabs in pretty-print test r=devtools-reviewers,ochameau\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320164\n", "files": ["devtools/client/styleeditor/test/browser_styleeditor_pretty.js"], "git_node": "52dd3e30810e093312476d027a52ec69ef4e6d6b", "git_parents": ["f8837d62196cdb46402a23a3bed555c21d70d4de"], "node": "a0295fa3af6bc02cb828e25eed0c1ed80f339111", "parents": ["24f87c3a9e14c1f38e4176c15088d05751d63044"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jackie Johnson \u003cjajohnson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065120 - [efficiency] Remove BaseTest's in-process test retry r=aaronmt\n\nBaseTest re-ran a failed test once, retrying on AssertionError, AssertionFailedError,\nUiObjectNotFoundException, NoMatchingViewException, IdlingResourceTimeoutException,\nRuntimeException and NullPointerException - in practice, on almost any failure. An\nintermittent assertion failure or an intermittent product NPE could fail the first\nattempt, pass the second, and report green.\n\nThe retry was also the only thing escaping the suite's isolation. Every test already\nruns in its own process with package data cleared (ANDROIDX_TEST_ORCHESTRATOR plus\nclearPackageData, app/build.gradle), but a retry happened inside one of those processes,\nso the second attempt inherited whatever the first left behind. The cleanup block it ran\nbetween attempts was a hand-maintained approximation of clearPackageData and did not\ncover history, site permissions, downloads, changed prefs, added search engines or\ncollections.\n\nFirebase already re-runs a failing test once (num-flaky-test-attempts in the TAE flank\nconfigs), in a fresh process, and reports it as flaky rather than silently green. That is\na strictly better retry than this one, so removing the in-process layer costs no coverage\nand removes up to two duplicate executions of every failing test.\n\nRemoved alongside it, all of which existed only to serve the retry:\n\n  - MAX_RETRIES and the attempt loop\n  - isRetryable()\n  - finishLeftoverActivities() and its two constants, which worked around the 45s\n    \"Could not launch intent ... HomeActivity\" failure caused by the previous attempt's\n    singleTask activity still being alive\n\nThe rule itself stays. composeRule must still be built per test, because the activity\nflags come from launchConfig(), which subclasses override, so the config has to be read\nbefore the rule is constructed.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320153\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/docs/gotchas.md", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/docs/guides/debugging-tests.md", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/helpers/BaseTest.kt"], "git_node": "ac41fd82b2242ba66393a5d50584a21344cba134", "git_parents": ["52dd3e30810e093312476d027a52ec69ef4e6d6b"], "node": "500f7ab0cadb54fbbb3a12939c06842522ff069d", "parents": ["a0295fa3af6bc02cb828e25eed0c1ed80f339111"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nika Layzell \u003cnika@thelayzells.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059018 - Explicitly record serializable support in components.conf, r=xpcom-reviewers,necko-reviewers,layout-reviewers,mccr8,dholbert,valentin\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315738\n", "f