12beaf34237da899ef30a8dfcb352e65c0516", "dbb64e7911d8507433dbd6a8f9a3eb3292e99d6e", "a513fe0b7087b720269fd39660afbe5664b5fc8b"], "user": "pstanciu@mozilla.com"}, "45152": {"changesets": [{"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064369 - Add an API for contributing items to the chrome text context menu. r=daleharvey\n\nThe reveal password item moves onto it as the first client. That's behavior-neutral: it was already a per-input item with per-open state, just hardcoded in the listener.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319496\n", "files": ["toolkit/content/editMenuOverlay.js", "toolkit/content/tests/chrome/file_edit_contextmenu.xhtml", "toolkit/content/tests/chrome/test_edit_contextmenu.html"], "git_node": "caf78051221bbcf5aaa525b35920901888c15d2c", "git_parents": ["a513fe0b7087b720269fd39660afbe5664b5fc8b"], "node": "78ea1b81c97450542745fefa573767f522162cc0", "parents": ["a9837bdf5b664b2d82bc1f37d56988e814d9e232"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064369 - Focus the input the chrome text context menu was opened on. r=daleharvey\n\nThe items reflect the commands enabled for whatever has focus, which right-clicking an input doesn't move to it. moz-input-box has always done this on popupshowing; consumers of the shared menu had no equivalent.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319497\n", "files": ["toolkit/content/editMenuOverlay.js"], "git_node": "709d85e1e19b6266b5f932c536061a44d6d3567b", "git_parents": ["caf78051221bbcf5aaa525b35920901888c15d2c"], "node": "e22a89cee20200d6d7b42c9a1f9095e37a6dcc3e", "parents": ["78ea1b81c97450542745fefa573767f522162cc0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065563 - Remove Jules from theme triage owner rotation. r=desktop-theme-reviewers,emilio\n\nAt the request of Jane\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320484\n", "files": ["browser/themes/triage.json"], "git_node": "7a00d307058961d0cf9cae6a879457b61986d926", "git_parents": ["709d85e1e19b6266b5f932c536061a44d6d3567b"], "node": "7b4609203ae794704c0efadb9d5c1c9856bc207c", "parents": ["e22a89cee20200d6d7b42c9a1f9095e37a6dcc3e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2032017 - Don't paint a panel-list's own surface inside a XUL panel. r=desktop-theme-reviewers,emilio\n\nThe panel's `::part(content)` already paints the background and text color, casts the shadow, and rounds and clips the corners. The switcher's list was casting a second shadow identical to the panel's, and the migration wizard's, which has no styling of its own, was painting a second background.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320143\n", "files": ["toolkit/content/widgets/panel-list/panel-list.css"], "git_node": "948897db62e676fddb26a9c54a94260856edaf00", "git_parents": ["7a00d307058961d0cf9cae6a879457b61986d926"], "node": "f052d7772b9885c9fca10c74540627f5bc783d8b", "parents": ["7b4609203ae794704c0efadb9d5c1c9856bc207c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2032017 - Clean up the switcher panel-list's styling. r=daleharvey,urlbar-reviewers\n\n`--panel-background` doesn't exist, so the background already fell back to transparent and the panel now suppresses it properly. The rest are no-ops that restate panel-list's or panel-item's own defaults, or lose to an `!important` in the shadow tree. What panel-item only gets right under nova moves into the proton branch, so it goes when proton does.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320144\n", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/urlbar.css"], "git_node": "2e2c6a2ef40c44d7c15464f8b8499bf4a3a66027", "git_parents": ["948897db62e676fddb26a9c54a94260856edaf00"], "node": "8dafeb25f0cd978f3e5fe46796aa140159d900d6", "parents": ["f052d7772b9885c9fca10c74540627f5bc783d8b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrea Marchesini \u003camarchesini@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062199 - Make the container list in about:preferences#container scollable, r=desktop-theme-reviewers,akulyk,jules\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317432\n", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/preferences/preferences.css"], "git_node": "49cb1667fe081ad5a5d1a59297780a2efa51e890", "git_parents": ["2e2c6a2ef40c44d7c15464f8b8499bf4a3a66027"], "node": "78cf14cd3362a9a8475aced3ff4d43fb42801409", "parents": ["8dafeb25f0cd978f3e5fe46796aa140159d900d6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Bumping Firefox l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD CLOSED TREE\n\nach -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\naf -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\nan -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\nar -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\nast -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\naz -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\nbe -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\nbg -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\nbn -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\nbo -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\nbqi -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\nbr -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\nbrx -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\nbs -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\nca -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\nca-valencia -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\ncak -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\nckb -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\ncs -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bbb95c3ad6c1caa07a7\ncy -\u003e 5850ddb03a0e52cb07b00bb