559ee2495b603f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Finn Terdal \u003cfterdal@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2060248 - FRO Template Updates for Terms of Service r=omc-reviewers,emcminn\n\nAdds support for a pre-onboarding screen that prompts the user to make\nFirefox the default browser and adds Firefox to the taskbar. Also\nhandles the Terms of Use acceptance, and a link to manage telemetry\ndata. Note that currently the link to Manage diagnostic and interactive\ndata doesn't do anything, which will be handled in a future ticket.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317535\n", "files": ["browser/components/aboutwelcome/assets/kit-sit-look-up.svg", "browser/components/aboutwelcome/content/aboutwelcome.bundle.js", "browser/components/aboutwelcome/content/aboutwelcome.css", "browser/components/aboutwelcome/jar.mn", "browser/components/aboutwelcome/tests/browser/browser_aboutwelcome_configurable_ui.js", "browser/components/aboutwelcome/tests/browser/browser_aboutwelcome_multiselect.js", "browser/components/asrouter/content-src/components/LinkParagraph.jsx", "browser/components/asrouter/content-src/components/MultiSelect.jsx", "browser/components/asrouter/content-src/components/MultiStageProtonScreen.jsx", "browser/components/asrouter/content-src/styles/_multistage.scss", "browser/components/asrouter/content/components/asrouter-newtab-multistage/asrouter-newtab-multistage.bundle.js", "browser/components/asrouter/content/components/asrouter-newtab-multistage/asrouter-newtab-multistage.css", "browser/components/asrouter/docs/feature-callout.md", "browser/components/asrouter/tests/unit/content-src/components/LinkParagraph.test.jsx", "browser/components/asrouter/tests/unit/content-src/components/MultiSelect.test.jsx"], "git_node": "a4bbcd8ba2e4c77bd7f54c2cf93de13810981038", "git_parents": ["21827d4ae2c6833d9ce2e7cda6b6dadb2c087c5c"], "node": "b3515916082f848bf776810dd899668ebca1018b", "parents": ["e8a7a2e2bcd58d7a0330c1bb015e7a94