 - Limit pinch locking to multi-touch pinch gestures. r=mstange\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320606\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/apz/src/AsyncPanZoomController.cpp", "gfx/layers/apz/test/gtest/APZTestCommon.h"], "git_node": "0fa968d56fc48393211c8100c9a3b8c2064f9957", "git_parents": ["75b9ce835ec9de73b07977611d60297081ccd6a8"], "node": "ccf36636095e44f528298e808f6c305247676e5a", "parents": ["f61a963a8dfed14826a32c50e816029f77fe4f98"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Exploding Joysticks \u003cExplodingJoysticks@proton.me\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1890400 - Remove nsPromptUtils.h, it is unused r=firefox-desktop-core-reviewers ,Gijs\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321036\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/windowwatcher/moz.build", "toolkit/components/windowwatcher/nsPromptUtils.h"], "git_node": "904964ee6be574735a9c3b140ac52275ba0cfea8", "git_parents": ["0fa968d56fc48393211c8100c9a3b8c2064f9957"], "node": "fe8f552f71ae537222fcbabcf9690fe4c236fc52", "parents": ["ccf36636095e44f528298e808f6c305247676e5a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Daniel Holbert \u003cdholbert@cs.stanford.edu\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2011632: Adjust directv WebCompat intervention to more narrowly target the affected site. r=webcompat-reviewers,twisniewski\n\nThe point of our intervention here was to address a UA-sniffing-based block on\nthe stream.directv.com website. Our intervention has been targeting\nall subdomains of directv.com, which turns out to have been unnecessary and\ncounterproductive, becuase the UA override breaks the directv login flow in\nsome way.\n\nThis patch narrows the intervention to *only* target stream.directv.com. With\nthat, I've confirmed that login works again and I can still access the\nstreaming page.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320973\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/webcompat/data/interventions/1728450-directv.com.json"], "git_node": "84