reverts commit 69889ef91e48ff681cd41a39a600c71aad7f8c83.\n", "files": ["toolkit/content/metrics.yaml"], "git_node": "c685b1a4809f7841d827709f2aa7b8310cd64462", "git_parents": ["31df762511e4012c8bd04a60182ac31027a3bbe6"], "node": "3e6086c58faac364ccd703e6370a42a1cab03782", "parents": ["0c0d70fa7061edcfd85ca02d674612836c1359e6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sandor Molnar \u003csmolnar@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2059620 - Pt 3 - Compute an over-thick border's interior split once r=gfx-reviewers,nical\" for causing WR test failures\n\nThis reverts commit 06dfa2cf965afeb3a74db61c6c72b943c18130cf.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2059620 - Pt 2 - Only run the app-unit round trip on an axis the scroll offset moves r=gfx-reviewers,nical\"\n\nThis reverts commit d71cf58127ffd4f1a28806dfb113ad0284c220ea.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2059620 - Pt 1 - Move the unsnapped prim rect back into the interning key and template r=gfx-reviewers,nical\"\n\nThis reverts commit 2d1438376db385d273082f81b9cfd22ba65bc712.\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/example-compositor/compositor/src/main.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/border.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/invalidation/cached_surface.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prepare.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/borders.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/gradient/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/image.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/line_dec.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/rectangle.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/text_run.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/render_backend.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_building.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/visibility.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender_api/src/display_list.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender_api/src/key_types.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/invalidation.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/offgrid_repaint_1.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/offgrid_repaint_2.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/border/border-overlap-split.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/border/border-overlap-split.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/border/reftest.list"], "git_node": "7830c5793c0215a95c3e0e3d7f5da2bf71a7c190", "git_parents": ["c685b1a4809f7841d827709f2aa7b8310cd64462"], "node": "441884f2e95e1197290d132ddc65337fd0cd5371", "parents": ["3e6086c58faac364ccd703e6370a42a1cab03782"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kershaw Chang \u003ckershaw@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063020 - Compare the full coalescing identity on a hash hit before joining an HTTP/2 connection, r=necko-reviewers,valentin\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319060\n", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/ConnectionDiagnostics.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/ConnectionEntry.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/ConnectionEntry.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpConnectionInfo.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpConnectionInfo.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpConnectionMgr.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpConnectionMgr.h"], "git_node": "49efe26ca15f809794766d181b62d1a2b64d7da6", "git_parents": ["7830c5793c0215a95c3e0e3d7f5da2bf71a7c190"], "node": "a8d4fa88cf1108c1be9f1c6b2f98515dbb4bce39", "parents": ["441884f2e95e1197290d132ddc65337fd0cd5371"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kershaw Chang \u003ckershaw@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063020 - Test, r=necko-reviewers,valentin\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319061\n", "files": ["netwerk/test/unit/test_connection_coalescing_hash_collision.js", "netwerk/test/unit/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "42ec6818671cef78d5fda4555b5fcf7dc2851be1", "git_parents": ["49efe26ca15f809794766d181b62d1a2b64d7da6"], "node": "e1549376179185c3200a96b4f0599e96da6a8839", "parents": ["a8d4fa88cf1108c1be9f1c6b2f98515dbb4bce39"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Calixte Denizet \u003ccalixte.denizet@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059930 - Default the save dialog to a local file's folder. r=Gijs\n\nAll file: URLs share one last-used directory, which may be unrelated\nto the source file.\n\nPrefer the source folder unless it is under the system temporary\ndirectory.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319792\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/pdfjs/test/browser.toml", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/test/browser_pdfjs_saveas.js", "toolkit/content/contentAreaUtils.js"], "git_node": "0b66f6adcfe7256342b445559409d8aaedd1d9f5", "git_parents": ["42ec6818671cef78d5fda4555b5fcf7dc2851be1"], "node": "8a588f2baf6d7b72a28f1308bdfbc48cd0657e7f", "parents": ["e1549376179185c3200a96b4f0599e96da6a8839"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rune Lillesveen \u003cfuthark@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064684 [wpt PR 62050] - Add fuzziness to corner-shape tests, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nAdd fuzziness to corner-shape tests\n\nTo make them pass in Blink\n\nBug: 546241037\nChange-Id: Icce8fa1993e9bbafadb6de50d872129e5ce40a00\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8267609\nCommit-Queue: Rune Lillesveen \u003cfuthark@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Morten Stenshorne \u003cmstensho@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1682109}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 370aa394aacad5d4cafefbc7f59690486fc0a494\nwpt-pr: 62050\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-borders/corner-shape/corner-shape-superellipse-concave.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-borders/corner-shape/corner-shape-superellipse-convex.html"], "git_node": "4abc0680f53be55d4fe29d50f0656c85a169727d", "git_parents": ["0b66f6adcfe7256342b445559409d8aaedd1d9f5"], "node": "e22c571f71a7b266bbd0221d63fdd61b8327bb00", "parents": ["8a588f2baf6d7b72a28f1308bdfbc48cd0657e7f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ahmad Saleem \u003c52317531+Ahmad-S792@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064687 [wpt PR 62044] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=321986, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/sho