cgi?id=321861, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=321861 (#61978)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 4ade42c6cc5c2e94cc7966315915ee327e4e9c1b\nwpt-pr: 61978\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/editing/dnd/datastore/datatransferitemlist-indexed-getter.html"], "git_node": "3f4f6c3391759b06a06efecea7f9d073218c24d4", "git_parents": ["e7b721229795f5e7bbedac46e4025fa7ecc75937"], "node": "b7ddf0e3b0e506dd63297f93c3e37787d6b068c1", "parents": ["78ee393c63bb913471a03e0814674398c073421f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Marcos C\u00e1ceres \u003ccaceres_m@apple.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055199 [wpt PR 61308] - [digital-credentials] Test CSP sandbox header propagates opacity to nested frames, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[digital-credentials] Test CSP sandbox header propagates opacity to nested frames (#61308)\n\nget-opaque-origin-combinations.https.html already covers the iframe `sandbox`\nattribute propagating an opaque origin to descendant frames, but it only covers a\n`Content-Security-Policy: sandbox` header at the top of a subtree (the header'd\ndocument itself). Add two cases showing the CSP header's opacity also propagates\nacross a nesting boundary, so navigator.credentials.get() from a deeper frame\nrejects with SecurityError:\n\n- a plain child nested inside a CSP: sandbox document, and\n- an allow-same-origin child, which must not be able to escape the propagated\n  opacity.\n\nPer HTML, a document's CSP-derived sandboxing flags are unioned into its active\nsandboxing flag set, which in turn feeds a child browsing context's creation\nsandboxing flags, so the sandboxed origin flag reaches descendants exactly as the\nattribute does.\n--\n\nwpt-commits: f12a2f2b30ffd4e5ce1c5893e97e64af3c4675ba\nwpt-pr: 61308\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/digital-credentials/get-opaque-origin-combinations.https.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/digital-credentials/support/dc-nest-csp-sandbox.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/digital-credentials/support/dc-nest-csp-sandbox.html.headers"], "git_node": "946a231015a5feaa1ff5a816a98ed28461caf7f9", "git_parents": ["3f4f6c3391759b06a06efecea7f9d073218c24d4"], "node": "e10abd6b533e758921d3d37fb3abf1ba8209f291", "parents": ["b7ddf0e3b0e506dd63297f93c3e37787d6b068c1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055199 [wpt PR 61308] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 61308\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/digital-credentials/get-opaque-origin-combinations.https.html.ini"], "git_node": "687ab95aeaa583c4a939c0c90011959a8dcdc6fe", "git_parents": ["946a231015a5feaa1ff5a816a98ed28461caf7f9"], "node": "de283f28f19e8242eaa46f28f0133ebaccd6a22d", "parents": ["e10abd6b533e758921d3d37fb3abf1ba8209f291"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ahmad Saleem \u003c52317531+Ahmad-S792@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064710 [wpt PR 62048] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=320438, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=320438 (#62048)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 69538df1b7f90a732f35c13530804664d3e86f46\nwpt-pr: 62048\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/svg/struct/reftests/reference/use-image-href-mutating-ref.svg", "testing/web-platform/tests/svg/struct/reftests/use-image-href-mutating-expected.svg", "testing/web-platform/tests/svg/struct/reftests/use-image-href-mutating.svg"], "git_node": "72991154bd5061973cfbfcd423685ee020abff13", "git_parents": ["687ab95aeaa583c4a939c0c90011959a8dcdc6fe"], "node": "529e2cc644dcf478e3eb52a646b9747f0d8d8d16", "parents": ["de283f28f19e8242eaa46f28f0133ebaccd6a22d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Karl Dubost \u003ckarlcow@apple.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064798 [wpt PR 62054] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=322081, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=322081 (#62054)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 2b4c587ca5fc1a9173a6cfd5672d45b341fb76f4\nwpt-pr: 62054\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/svg/path/error-handling/path-data-error-geometry.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/svg/types/scripted/SVGPointList-error-handling.html"], "git_node": "eeb719a782a243eee34dc3b3d80acca570293634", "git_parents": ["72991154bd5061973cfbfcd423685ee020abff13"], "node": "a33b08478566846bafafd3f2aae2c3498774b140", "parents": ["529e2cc644dcf478e3eb52a646b9747f0d8d8d16"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Noam Rosenthal \u003cnrosenthal@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064813 [wpt PR 62051] - Throw when trusted types forces sanitization of XML, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nThrow when trusted types forces sanitization of XML\n\nAlso allow null sanitizer to propagate through createParserOptions.\n\nSince sanitizer doesn't work on XML, throw early to avoid a false sense\nof security.\n\nBug: 491743369\nChange-Id: I1fed9c13cd3c1303cf7b40423dd1e800a51d028d\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8225007\nReviewed-by: Daniel Vogelheim \u003cvogelheim@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Noam Rosenthal \u003cnrosenthal@google.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1682188}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 0aa6716748b4cb48882d117b26efafd9071afe43\nwpt-pr: 62051\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/sanitizer-api/parsehtmlunsafe-with-trustedtypes.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/sanitizer-api/sethtml-with-trustedtypes-createParserOptions-null.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/sanitizer-api/sethtml-with-trustedtypes.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/sanitizer-api/sethtml-xml-document-sanitizer.tentative.html"], "git_node": "a5bb3b0b34b8a5ebb45d4cb30e9634df425e2934", "git_parents": ["eeb719a782a243eee34dc3b3d80acca570293634"], "node": "3f18148fc11ccbd5a3d954eaacc62611a7b16e8d", "parents": ["a33b08478566846bafafd3f2aae2c3498774b140"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064813 [wpt PR 62051] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62051\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/sanitizer-api/sethtml-with-trustedtypes-createParserOptions-null.tentative.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/sanitizer-api/sethtml-xml-document-sanitizer.tentative.html.ini"], "git_node": "31d3e3e5813074cdba64a0efcb81fd187c690896", "git_parents": ["a5bb3b0b34b8a5ebb45d4cb30e9634df425e2934"], "node": "73dea876f81f825be280225b2d6f5f487ac70fc2", "parents": ["3f18148fc11ccbd5a3d954eaacc62611a7b16e8d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kurt Catti-Schmidt \u003ckschmi@microsoft.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064841 [wpt PR 62052] - [css] Fix cascade after adopted stylesheet reorder, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[css] Fix cascade after adopted stylesheet reorder\n\nThis change fixes an existing rule invalidation bug when stylesheets are\nreordered. CompareActiveStyleSheets tracks insertions, removals, and\nrule changes, but does not preserve enough ordering information to\nidentify reordered sheets. This change adds detection for this scenario\nby sorting each array separately, instead of merging them and then\nsorting, which loses information about relative positions.\n\nA WPT is added that demonstrates this issue and passes with this change.\nThe WPT passes in Firefox but fails 10 sub-cases in Chromium with stale\nvalues without these fixes applied.\n\nBug: 545636895\nChange-Id: Ie085c229a2d0601f8cd7e5c00ab0d2620e4ac20d\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8237191\nCommit-Queue: Kurt Catti-Schmidt \u003ckschmi@microsoft.com\u003e\nReviewed-by: Anders Hartvoll Ruud \u003candruud@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1682323}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 5567af02257fc3395879b579dcc3e1f746b9ced8\nwpt-pr: 62052\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/cssom/adoptedstylesheets-cascade-order.html"], "git_node": "597c0251797f0b91f48eaf2c2447d220bdc9a02a", "git_parents": ["31d3e3e5813074cdba64a0efcb81fd187c690896"], "node": "341d065184a2f5720b3debd02996733c97c113f9", "parents": ["73dea876f81f825be280225b2d6f5f487ac70fc2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Marcos C\u00e1ceres \u003ccaceres_m@apple.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064665 [wpt PR 62037] - [digital-credentials] Test that destroying the requesting document frees the coordinator, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[digital-credentials] Test that destroying the requesting document frees the coordinator (#62037)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: b4f80e3847f560ecf7053170c99926f1e2e5cf98\nwpt-pr: 62037\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/digital-credentials/concurrent-requests.https.html"], "git_node": "b15f69bf23e90bd709a8e2fbfdded87ed1b4a923", "git_parents": ["597c0251797f0b91f48eaf2c2447d220bdc9a02a"], "node": "b0e1d6ef8ccffb244498ba02866e54efda101f59", "parents": ["341d065184a2f5720b3debd02996733c97c113f9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064665 [wpt PR 62037] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62037\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/digital-credentials/concurrent-requests.https.html.ini"], "git_node": "c3649cb847a9e0ba83fd25a2619825eda3a252ab", "git_parents": ["b15f69bf23e90bd709a8e2fbfdded87ed1b4a923"], "node": "3f2ed17c05e4ed4adc84ee305b56b67673bfb0f2", "parents": ["b0e1d6ef8ccffb244498ba02866e54efda101f59"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Noam Rosenthal \u003cnoamr@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053639 [wpt PR 61156] - Un-tentative out of order streaming tests, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nHTML: out-of-order streaming tests\n\nMove them away from