efault", "desc": "Bug 2066256: Add attributes so DTE checks run on Nightly, r=taskgraph-reviewers,ahal,jcristau\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321069\n", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/dte-test/kind.yml"], "git_node": "242510ef57ae513394f6ef3bd72e18bea3ee733a", "git_parents": ["73da04da85289aac01c08749730ee0564ea013c6"], "node": "9ea3b95a25afba96111ef648defe3d9e14562dcc", "parents": ["579cf441f25817919092a71f94a7c89f4eceafbe"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Giulia Cardieri \u003cgcardieri@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055066: Include Smart Form Fill telemetry r=omarg,vazish\n\nTelemetry doc: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1xGklaZcgN6MwYT8-P7V4211U54IK3iSca8tD1eOYuAg/edit?tab=t.npojtw383tyi#heading=h.2fiaa8zb7ga3\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317197\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/metrics.yaml", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/SmartFormFillModel.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/browser/browser_smart_form_fill_model.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/actors/SmartFormFillChild.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/actors/SmartFormFillParent.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/SmartFormFillController.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/SmartFormFillDocument.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/SmartFormFillTelemetry.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/moz.build", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_smartformfill_telemetry.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/test_smartformfill_telemetry.html"], "git_node": "88a35f00a31ab280ea8cc03a50a301a45f7607ff", "git_parents": ["242510ef57ae513394f6ef3bd72e18bea3ee733a"], "node": "9c3d23d0c2d5e8754afcb6e8ca878736456e3919", "parents": ["9ea3b95a25afba96111ef648defe3d9e14562dcc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Beth Rennie \u003cbeth@brennie.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064791 - Correctly set prefFlips on enrollments when overwriting r=ralkhulaidi,nimbus-reviewers,emcminn\n\nWe accidentally were settings prefFlips = setPrefs when ovewriting\nenrollments. Thankfully this is not a case that could be hit currently\nas rollout re-enrollment, while supported, is not live in Experimenter.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320235\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/nimbus/lib/Enrollments.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/nimbus/test/NimbusTestUtils.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/nimbus/test/unit/test_RemoteSettingsExperimentLoader_updateRecipes.js"], "git_node": "48b9028d81a13ddc5e1dcad3d49e05390677b9aa", "git_parents": ["88a35f00a31ab280ea8cc03a50a301a45f7607ff"], "node": "2ed1151943c7f09fab79b81391b668f69158ac77", "parents": ["9c3d23d0c2d5e8754afcb6e8ca878736456e3919"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Greg Tatum \u003ctatum.creative@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063103 - Add a ChromeUtils.addProfilerCounter() to hook up counters to JS r=canova,profiler-reviewers\n\nThis wires in a ChromeProfilerCounter into the ChromeUtils so that\ncounters can be created and incremented from Chrome-privileged\nJavaScript code.\n\nSee the test_profiler_counter.js for the characterization of the\nbehavior. There is some tricky ownership of the ChromeProfilerCounter\nobject as the profiler retains a raw pointer. The refs are shared\nbetween the SpiderMonkey garbage collector and the profiler core.\n\nThe lifetime management is independent between the two entities, but\nthis is all exercised in the xpcshell test, and should hopefully be\nadequately documented.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318281\n", "files": ["dom/base/ChromeUtils.cpp", "dom/base/ChromeUtils.h", "dom/base/ProfilerCounter.cpp", "dom/base/ProfilerCounter.h", "dom/base/moz.build", "dom/chrome-webidl/ChromeUtils.webidl", "dom/chrome-webidl/ProfilerCounter.webidl", "dom/chrome-webidl/moz.build", "tools/profiler/core/ChromeProfilerCounter.cpp", "tools/profiler/core/platform.cpp", "tools/profiler/moz.build", "tools/profiler/public/ChromeProfilerCounter.h", "tools/profiler/public/ProfilerCounts.h", "tools/profiler/tests/xpcshell/test_profiler_counter.js", "tools/profiler/tests/xpcshell/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "2534cbb3208c34ac4e2dbe289e3e2b8fc38d4160", "git_parents": ["48b9028d81a13ddc5e1dcad3d49e05390677b9aa"], "node": "d84f6336051bf8362f7a4b309149ab3536f707cc", "parents": ["2ed1151943c7f09fab79b81391b668f69158ac77"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Greg Tatum \u003ctatum.creative@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063103 - Use wide Win32 API variants in profiler platform.cpp to fix unified-build bustage r=profiler-reviewers,canova\n\nAdding ChromeProfilerCounter.cpp to UNIFIED_SOURCES re-chunked the unified\nbuild and pulled platform.cpp into a translation unit where the\nstl_wrappers windows.h deletes the ANSI Win32 functions. Switch the three\naffected calls to the explicit wide variants (GetVersionExW/OSVERSIONINFOW\nand GetModuleHandleW), which the wide-string arguments already required.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321119\n", "files": ["tools/profiler/core/platform.cpp"], "git_node": "b9f09f4b4c6cbc72100d5a54b484f7865a3b0b6b", "git_parents": ["2534cbb3208c34ac4e2dbe289e3e2b8fc38d4160"], "node": "467594188bc14047484417d6997839567265aa6c", "parents": ["d84f6336051bf8362f7a4b309149ab3536f707cc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Cristian Tuns \u003cctuns@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2063065 - Make MSIX background tasks activate and run in a full trust process. r=nrishel,browser-installer-reviewers,aborondo,frontend-codestyle-reviewers\" for causing build bustages with msixcomserver_s\n\nThis reverts commit 23bfb4dc67a35b55c97b8e2b4fb7b6a6ed46d025.\n", "files": ["Cargo.lock", "browser/installer/windows/msix/AppxManifest.xml.in", "build/rust/mozbuild/generate_buildconfig.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/repackaging/msix.py", "toolkit/components/backgroundtasks/BackgroundTasks.cpp", "toolkit/components/taskscheduler/TaskSchedulerWinMSIXImpl.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/taskscheduler/nsIWinBackgroundTaskRegistrar.idl", "toolkit/components/taskscheduler/rust/Cargo.toml", "toolkit/components/taskscheduler/rust/src/lib.rs", "toolkit/components/taskscheduler/tests/xpcshell/xpcshell.toml", "toolkit/modules/AppConstants.sys.mjs", "toolkit/modules/moz.build", "toolkit/moz.configure", "toolkit/mozapps/msixcomserver-rust/Cargo.toml", "toolkit/mozapps/msixcomserver-rust/src/lib.rs", "toolkit/mozapps/msixcomserver/msixcomserver.cpp", "toolkit/mozapps/msixcomserver/msixcomserver.def", "tools/lint/eslint/eslint-plugin-mozilla/lib/rules/valid-ci-uses.mjs"], "git_node": "c56948641e407350cd12f5ab90b15c8f10b41eb6", "git_parents": ["b9f09f4b4c6cbc72100d5a54b484f7865a3b0b6b"], "node": "d440d21a7138b929ea2867e862197d6e82415c1b", "parents": ["467594188bc14047484417d6997839567265aa6c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Bumping Firefox l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD CLOSED TREE\n\nach -\u003e ade2bacae0ff59640c21c02bdc08bee410e6309b\naf -\u003e ade2bacae0ff59640c21c02bdc08bee410e6309b\nan -\u003e ade2bacae0ff59640c21c02bdc08bee410e6309b\nar -\u003e ade2bacae0ff59640c21c02bdc08bee410e6309b\nast -\u003e ade2bacae0ff59640c21c02bdc08bee410e6309b\naz -\u003e ade2bacae0ff59640c21c02bdc08bee410e6309b\nbe -\u003e ade2bacae0ff59640c21c02bdc08bee410e6309b\nbg -\u003e ade2bacae0ff59640c21c02bdc08bee410e6309b\nbn -\u003e ade2bacae0ff59640c21c02bdc08bee410e6309b\nbo -\u003e ade2bacae0ff59640c21c02bdc08bee410e6309b\nbqi -\u003e ade2bacae0ff59640c21c02bdc08bee410e6309b\nbr -\u003e ade2bacae0ff59640c21c02bdc08bee410e6309b\nbrx -\u003e ade2bacae0ff59640c21c02bdc08bee410e6309b\nbs -\u003e ade2bacae0ff59640c21c02bdc08bee410e6309b\nca -\u003e ade2baca