\u003cmoriken@kimamass.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065858 [wpt PR 62152] - Delete empty docs/META.yml that fails lint, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nDelete empty docs/META.yml that fails lint\n\n6763c9ecac removed the last reviewer and left an empty META.yml.\nwpt lint --all rejects that as INVALID-META-FILE, which is currently\nfailing CI on every PR.\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 53bc812da2ed81179ebd1ba76b2d197cc4747d12\nwpt-pr: 62152\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/docs/META.yml"], "git_node": "a0239b857045fb5790ce5f04bb5a73384274d670", "git_parents": ["64ae477bfacb26f57acf616a94052d3115e613b5"], "node": "46a8cccd21b0eaf0fa9022ebc44fe945aab16366", "parents": ["02ee503c78bebbb6ce3b69350349aa23cd46aa5e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Abhijith Nair \u003cabhijithnair@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065917 [wpt PR 62166] - Revert \"[bfcache] Prevent JS callbacks from running when context is frozen\", a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nRevert \"[bfcache] Prevent JS callbacks from running when context is frozen\"\n\nThis reverts commit fab48e05e108a252067742ccfb0ae5bd1349595c.\n\nReason for revert: Causes WebView to not load content in certain cases. See b/547720473\n\nOriginal change's description:\n\u003e [bfcache] Prevent JS callbacks from running when context is frozen\n\u003e\n\u003e Before this CL, JavaScript callbacks were only stopped when context is\n\u003e paused. This CL changes it so that they stop running when context is\n\u003e frozen, too.\n\u003e\n\u003e Migrating from `IsContextPaused()` to `IsContextFrozenOrPaused()` is the\n\u003e general approach we take.\n\u003e\n\u003e Bug: 511277457\n\u003e Change-Id: I0b7cc83324d27591b034c31fa190106b61442174\n\u003e Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7894097\n\u003e Reviewed-by: Kentaro Hara \u003charaken@chromium.org\u003e\n\u003e Reviewed-by: Yuki Shiino \u003cyukishiino@chromium.org\u003e\n\u003e Commit-Queue: Yuzu Saijo \u003cyuzus@chromium.org\u003e\n\u003e Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1648072}\n\nBug: 511277457\nChange-Id: I5106249ae28c7446cdee3fdcc5a345bec09602a0\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8274931\nCommit-Queue: Peter Beverloo \u003cpeter@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Peter Beverloo \u003cpeter@chromium.org\u003e\nAuto-Submit: Abhijith Nair \u003cabhijithnair@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Kentaro Hara \u003charaken@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1684551}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: c2a2fce69e5c2509d9dc28440ec8b42532e5c293\nwpt-pr: 62166\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/browsers/browsing-the-web/back-forward-cache/weblocks-worker.https.window.js"], "git_node": "ddc6557568dce941a9fb4cfa621e823082e072ed", "git_parents": ["a0239b857045fb5790ce5f04bb5a73384274d670"], "node": "9c50ce48621f59e688120193f1fd7049ffa95fd2", "parents": ["46a8cccd21b0eaf0fa9022ebc44fe945aab16366"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sammy Gill \u003csammy.gill@apple.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065801 [wpt PR 62142] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=321104, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=321104 (#62142)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 44b3881ea935492550f5b3f54adcb303b8bda512\nwpt-pr: 62142\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-box/margin-trim/computed-margin-values/block-container-block-end-nested-child.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-box/margin-trim/computed-margin-values/block-container-block-end-with-self-collapsing-children.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-box/margin-trim/computed-margin-values/block-container-block-end.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-box/margin-trim/computed-margin-values/block-container-block-start-child-with-border.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-box/margin-trim/computed-margin-values/block-container-b