4f22ba80eb95d90e88dbede67ad45a6ef40", "parents": ["2e855a51a64f14e542290ceb263b5bf86554c613"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Simon Pieters \u003czcorpan@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065232 [wpt PR 62084] - Add missing preamble to out-of-order streaming tests, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nAdd missing preamble to out-of-order streaming tests\n\nThis regressed in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/61748\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: dd1c92d4f9e3955d062378ee74acd5728806274b\nwpt-pr: 62084\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/dom/partial-updates/tentative/template-for-case-sensitive-dom-inserted.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/semantics/scripting-1/the-template-element/template-for/template-for-case-sensitive-dom-inserted.html"], "git_node": "5c677ceea8ded88fd680c66b8be791bc764e98e2", "git_parents": ["a7115474f73afada0d7c85cb73bbebbc7276757e"], "node": "7748d49409bb47d1da77bf8f530c26c39c985cd0", "parents": ["889a14f22ba80eb95d90e88dbede67ad45a6ef40"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065232 [wpt PR 62084] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62084\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/html/dom/partial-updates/tentative/template-for-case-sensitive-dom-inserted.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/semantics/scripting-1/the-template-element/template-for/template-for-case-sensitive-dom-inserted.html.ini"], "git_node": "40c759c03c3950a68f830b52b65d32db2ed4d8bd", "git_parents": ["5c677ceea8ded88fd680c66b8be791bc764e98e2"], "node": "48abb0fdc8e7a4502fb6afc545dde9180c81127f", "parents": ["7748d49409bb47d1da77bf8f530c26c39c985cd0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jason Leo \u003ccgqaq@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066015 [wpt PR 62168] - Revert \"Skip invisible descendants in background-clip text masks\", a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nRevert \"Skip invisible descendants in background-clip text masks\"\n\nThis reverts commit ae2ae3a20d7d31babf90774c3564560a05d81da5.\n\nReason for revert: It fixes an 'issue' that is non-standard behavior in Safari and Firefox, leading us to the wrong implementation of the CSS spec.\n\nSee: https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/14373\n\nOriginal change's description:\n\u003e Skip invisible descendants in background-clip text masks\n\u003e\n\u003e Fully transparent self-painting descendants should not leave glyphs\n\u003e in an ancestor's text mask.\n\u003e\n\u003e Bug: 534893146\n\u003e Change-Id: I3352447d2aea4f19ba4e853a9173dfd3d019574d\n\u003e Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8119590\n\u003e Commit-Queue: Jason Leo \u003ccgqaq@chromium.org\u003e\n\u003e Reviewed-by: Fredrik S\u00f6derquist \u003cfs@opera.com\u003e\n\u003e Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1664641}\n\nBug: 534893146\nFixed: 548727808\nChange-Id: I59e48611b0b3bb274642e1d9cf08234a4d8f4d70\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8282496\nReviewed-by: Rune Lillesveen \u003cfuthark@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Jason Leo \u003ccgqaq@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1684636}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 72badca3f1df4c3071784032b6f239b93f68dfcd\nwpt-pr: 62168\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-backgrounds/background-clip/clip-text-stacking-context-child-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-backgrounds/background-clip/clip-text-stacking-context-child.html"], "git_node": "5b502b06e9738438b5b5ba99ef807ff2135ea0a0", "git_parents": ["40c759c03c3950a68f830b52b65d32db2ed4d8bd"], "node": "7ea0ad27de5cb0607dab6d091b5dcd5a295de603", "parents": ["48abb0fdc8e7a4502fb6afc545dde9180c81127f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephen McGruer \u003cjcscottiii@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063162 [wpt PR 61898] - Add Payment Method Manifest Link Header & RFC 8288 test suite, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nAdd Payment Method Manifest Link Header & RFC 8288 test suite (#61898)w\n\nTests include:\n- Missing Link header (direct manifest body) failure\n- ASCII case-insensitive rel attribute matching (rel=\"PAYMENT-METHOD-MANIFEST\")\n- RFC 8288 unquoted parameter parsing (rel=payment-method-manifest)\n- Extra parameter parsing (foo=bar)\n- Multiple Link headers (selecting correct rel)\n- Incorrect rel attribute (rel=\"stylesheet\") failure\n- Non-HTTPS target URL scheme failure\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 8e70fa4922a98bedb5e6077f95af4af8ba1d0b87\nwpt-pr: 61898\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-basic-success.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-case-insensitive-rel.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-missing.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-multiple-links.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-multiple-manifest-links.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-multiple-rel.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-non-https.https.sub.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-space-separated-rel.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-unquoted-rel.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-with-parameters.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-wrong-rel.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/resources/helpers.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/resources/payment-method-identifier.py"], "git_node": "ed05cad70b1de45383f6676726b998ea1f293e8a", "git_parents": ["5b502b06e9738438b5b5ba99ef807ff2135ea0a0"], "node": "e7701699ebad7a7f05e349f5bc85d50877a0ced9", "parents": ["7ea0ad27de5cb0607dab6d091b5dcd5a295de603"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063162 [wpt PR 61898] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 61898\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/payment-method-manifest/link-header-case-insensitive-rel.https.window.js.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/payment-method-manifest/link-header-missing.https.window.js.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/payment-method-manifest/link-header-multiple-links.https.window.js.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/payment-method-manifest/link-header-multiple-manifest-links.https.window.js.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/payment-method-manifest/link-header-multiple-rel.https.window.js.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/payment-method-manifest/link-header-non-https.https.sub.window.js.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/payment-method-manifest/link-header-space-separated-rel.https.window.js.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/payment-method-manifest/link-header-unquoted-rel.https.window.js.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/payment-method-manifest/link-header-with-parameters.https.window.js.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/payment-method-manifest/link-header-wrong-rel.https.window.js.ini"], "git_node": "de29746c7546ae893316d7a3c0aee95e42b17f79", "git_parents": ["ed05cad70b1de45383f6676726b998ea1f293e8a"], "node": "ed57333c8993414830ef3585eab6c5d2ebd15d02", "parents": ["e7701699ebad7a7f05e349f5bc85d50877a0ced9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rune Lillesveen \u003cfuthark@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066133 [wpt PR 62173] - Add tests for anchored(fallback) and tree-scoped names, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nAdd tests for anchored(fallback) and tree-scoped names\n\nPer spec, anchored(fallback: --foo) matches --foo from any tree-scope.\nAdd tests and remove out-of-date comment.\n\nChange-Id: I9096bc4e68c48020d9a6caa3af2cb231cd4b08c7\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8280650\nReviewed-by: Morten Stenshorne \u003cmstensho@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Rune Lillesveen \u003cfuthark@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1684723}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: c13b60bc35f734850ab357603c4e58286ef2e44c\nwpt-pr: 62173\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-anchor-position/container-queries/anchored-fallback-tree-scope.html"], "git_node": "64489ccc163c214b7b396490acc4a920591dde9f", "git_parents": ["de29746c7546ae893316d7a3c0aee95e42b17f79"], "node": "9fe50a8bc6cef88cad4e4b304ac37d0ebece7731", "parents": ["ed57333c8993414830ef3585eab6c5d2ebd15d02"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066133 [wpt PR 62173] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62173\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-anchor-position/container-queries/anchored-fallback-tree-scope.html.ini"], "git_node": "462279ace9fa220a7e91c410d551337210c16e0e", "git_parents": ["64489ccc163c214b7b396490acc4a920591dde9f"], "node": "e68ee4d0562a3e3b2378f13bf80b6a6b446a856c", "parents": ["9fe50a8bc6cef88cad4e4b304ac37d0ebece7731"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Anne van Kesteren \u003cannevk@annevk.nl\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065853 [wpt PR 62149] - Document named properties: drop object/embed exposedness, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nDocument named properties: drop object/embed exposedness\n\nNo browser implements the \"exposed\" filtering for document named\nproperties consistently, and the nested-object assertions in\nnameditem-names.html fail everywhere. Follow the proposal in\nwhatwg/html#12787 and stop distinguishing exposed from unexposed\nobject and embed elements.\n\nAlso add coverage for the named property value algorithm with nested\nobject and embed elements, which had none: nameditem-names.html only\nexercises the supported property names algorithm, so the fact that\nimplementations disagree between the two went untested.\n\nFor whatwg/html#12787.\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 422f0eb5bac9ba64d5470b83c946ff99d85e3e1f\nwpt-pr: 62149\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/dom/documents/dom-tree-accessors/nameditem-07.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/dom/documents/dom-tree-accessors/nameditem-names.html"], "git_node": "6a2692dc97c8d73dccbd10ae3ecf4392aec09a37", "git_parents": ["462279ace9fa220a7e91c410d551337210c16e0e"], "node": "3bf2fb8a1519f2f955e5a165df385e494d18902c", "parents": ["e68ee4d0562a3e3b2378f13bf80b6a6b446a856c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065853 [wpt PR 62149] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62149\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/html/dom/documents/dom-tree-accessors/nameditem-empty-name-dynamic-crash.html.ini"], "git_node": "8f08b54be3c70f728e862ff09d38f236a15861a5", "git_parents": ["6a2692dc97c8d73dccbd10ae3ecf4392aec09a37"], "node": "54f2077da41ed5c27b5cb419f249cca1cf34a12d", "parents": ["3bf2fb8a1519f2f955e5a165df385e494d18902c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sammy Gill \u003csammy.gill@apple.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065781 [wpt PR 62133] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=320558, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=320558 (#62133)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 593ae57a2ab50bced8ba0f69cd5703218c9f815b\nwpt-pr: 62133\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-flexbox/flexbox-baseline-and-last-baseline-groups-line-size.html"], "git_node": "a9202e436061d394474e6ed37d38ca63a7773b96", "git_parents": ["8f08b54be3c70f728e862ff09d38f236a15861a5"], "node": "8b8eee4a7b4fd57eef711d80486455815c6d00ef", "parents": ["54f2077da41ed5c27b5cb419f249cca1cf34a12d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065781 [wpt PR 62133] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62133\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-flexbox/anonymous-flex-item-document-white-space-crash.html.ini"], "git_node": "a8e738422c452d85e1d651664120ee7a2c6b0784", "git_parents": ["a9202e436061d394474e6ed37d38ca63a7773b96"], "node": "0b670c2f490b6c6fb8a57bf4c46790ad8551b95e", "parents": ["8b8eee4a7b4fd57eef711d80486455815c6d00ef"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sammy Gill \u003csammy.gill@apple.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065779 [wpt PR 62132] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=316353, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=316353 (#62132)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: fa7e05e6d9820d29c7195122effed2aa76b12a5a\nwpt-pr: 62132\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-flexbox/flex-item-min-width-min-content-max-width-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-flexbox/flex-item-min-width-min-content-max-width.html"], "git_node": "589f3667ca3bb4448b27f54626e757ad6064f957", "git_parents": ["a8e738422c452d85e1d651664120ee7a2c6b0784"], "node": "e552a621b05203ed203e7cbe6c6b650df616556e", "parents": ["0b670c2f490b6c6fb8a57bf4c46790ad8551b95e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sam Sneddon \u003cgsnedders@apple.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064577 [wpt PR 62028] - Add a test deleting the WebDriver session from a different HTTP connection, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nAdd a test deleting the WebDriver session from a different HTTP connection\n\nClosing the connection doesn't close the session per spec, so this\nshould work.\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: c9d334ff13eb008427bcdd1bdc6f85d71c276cc5\nwpt-pr: 62028\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/webdriver/tests/classic/delete_session/delete.py"], "git_node": "bc003f184e3481f9ceba811f46b80a1a7098f9a0", "git_parents": ["589f3667ca3bb4448b27f54626e757ad6064f957"], "n