249d3c75b9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066158 [wpt PR 62175] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62175\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-041.html.ini"], "git_node": "8bfe4044d2b50b9964cb1d70a834c5f7d13b674a", "git_parents": ["1646cf07ad48f3adf64eac0ef985b282df060c76"], "node": "b908bc5d019b032e981b39b1e340a4b5419f2869", "parents": ["77acd17550ee40dc7b6f40ded94e097af3f6c6ca"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Javier Contreras Tenorio \u003cjaviercon@microsoft.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066180 [wpt PR 62176] - [masonry] Add grid-lanes rule lists WPTs, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[masonry] Add grid-lanes rule lists WPTs\n\nAdd WPT tests for gap-decoration list and repeater assignment in\ngrid-lanes. The cases cover grid-axis assignment, independent\nstacking-axis lanes, spanners, dense packing, and reversed fill and\ntrack directions.\n\nThe references encode the final CSSWG placement-order model and expose\nthe remaining implementation gaps where iterators do not restart per\nlane or follow reverse placement.\n\nhttps://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/14156.\n\nBug: 343257585\nChange-Id: I80b20bab311697eb4dff2b4b9dcada4733285276\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8267634\nReviewed-by: Kurt Catti-Schmidt \u003ckschmi@microsoft.com\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Javier Contreras \u003cjaviercon@microsoft.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1684851}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 229083b8dd7edd9e00ff3bcc9e48c792ea24a643\nwpt-pr: 62176\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-dense-order-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-dense-order.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-fill-reverse-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-fill-reverse.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-grid-axis-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-grid-axis.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-repeat-auto-stacking-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-repeat-auto-stacking.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-spanner-independent-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-spanner-independent.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-stacking-types-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-stacking-types.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/row-gap-decorations-list-stacking-axis-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/row-gap-decorations-list-stacking-axis.html"], "git_node": "1b813edb2f83e0fb8e65dd48446e2ace959d0ff5", "git_parents": ["8bfe4044d2b50b9964cb1d70a834c5f7d13b674a"], "node": "618d3f815de5aeff45310752e2b0f1d9e95d7669", "parents": ["b908bc5d019b032e981b39b1e340a4b5419f2869"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066180 [wpt PR 62176] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62176\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-dense-order.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-fill-reverse.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-grid-axis.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-repeat-auto-stacking.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-spanner-independent.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/column-gap-decorations-list-stacking-types.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-gaps/grid-lanes/row-gap-decorations-list-stacking-axis.html.ini"], "git_node": "7a8d2d1ccd5744c01c1645e733ae4af02aec1fbc", "git_parents": ["1b813edb2f83e0fb8e65dd48446e2ace959d0ff5"], "node": "710aff425adf51da49875cbe1a6f87c46cdae7ec", "parents": ["618d3f815de5aeff45310752e2b0f1d9e95d7669"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Christensen \u003cachristensen@apple.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059306 [wpt PR 61619] - WebTransportConnectionStats members should be optional,, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebTransportConnectionStats members should be optional, (#61619)\n\naccording to https://www.w3.org/TR/webtransport/#web-transport-connection-stats\nThis is from https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/70482\n--\n\nwpt-commits: c782dc74987a77da4e881042fa919bf7f03d21cd\nwpt-pr: 61619\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/webtransport/stats.https.any.js"], "git_node": "d20007bd85c1d8c3a78f28be19c1611a9d46a090", "git_parents": ["7a8d2d1ccd5744c01c1645e733ae4af02aec1fbc"], "node": "52791332c3a204520e27ee699711bc514d3ccbde", "parents": ["710aff425adf51da49875cbe1a6f87c46cdae7ec"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florin Malita \u003cfmalita@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066301 [wpt PR 62182] - [canvas] Fix a couple of enhanced text metrics tests, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[canvas] Fix a couple of enhanced text metrics tests\n\nThe reference/expected versions inadvertently include getTextClusters()\ncalls, which fail when the feature is not available.  Since the test\nimplementations also fail the same way, they match the reference and\nappear to pass unexpectedly.\n\nRemove the unneeded calls, which allows the reference version to render\ncorrectly even with the feature disabled.\n\nBug: 514632337\nChange-Id: I88a27a934e504cffe48ec83a57699f3f228eac35\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8282358\nReviewed-by: Julia Lavrova \u003cjlavrova@google.com\u003e\nReviewed-by: Stephen Chenney \u003cschenney@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Florin Malita \u003cfmalita@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1685065}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 7413adf41ac497181510ff906de6ba842bd21e48\nwpt-pr: 62182\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/element/text/2d.text.measure.fillTextCluster-font-change.tentative-expected.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/element/text/2d.text.measure.strokeTextCluster-font-change.tentative-expected.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/offscreen/text/2d.text.measure.fillTextCluster-font-change.tentative-expected.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/offscreen/text/2d.text.measure.strokeTextCluster-font-change.tentative-expected.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/tools/yaml/text.yaml"], "git_node": "f6c65a76248cf32742f7ea5728fd08bdf6770f90", "git_parents": ["d20007bd85c1d8c3a78f28be19c1611a9d46a090"], "node": "b041b12212a4d2340280bb4866a2263e33fcba46", "parents": ["52791332c3a204520e27ee699711bc514d3ccbde"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ari Chivukula \u003carichiv@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066262 [wpt PR 62181] - [WPT] Split up resource-timing/response-status-code.html, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[WPT] Split up resource-timing/response-status-code.html\n\nThis test has 350 assertions (around 4x as many as any other test in the\nfolder: https://wpt.fyi/results/resource-timing).\n\nGiven the timeouts we're seeing on MacOS and the inconsistency across\nthem on which parts fail, let's try splitting this thing up.\n\nFixed: 542753852\nChange-Id: I2c2457b72c3d03c6f7bd0935f463fb243c87538f\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8281551\nCommit-Queue: Ari Chivukula \u003carichiv@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Vladimir Levin \u003cvmpstr@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Vladimir Levin \u003cvmpstr@chromium.org\u003e\nAuto-Submit: Ari Chivukula \u003carichiv@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1685070}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 22fdf539205767794b96c9d4af5d4304ed9c3996\nwpt-pr: 62181\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/resource-timing/object-not-found-adds-entry.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/resource-timing/object-not-found-after-cross-origin-redirect.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/resource-timing/resources/resource-loaders.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/resource-timing/response-status-code.cors.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/resource-timing/response-status-code.cross-origin-redirect.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/resource-timing/response-status-code.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/resource-timing/response-status-code.no-cors.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/resource-timing/response-status-code.same-origin-redirect.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/resource-timing/response-status-code.same-origin.html"], "git_node": "fb50129f431e9c5067cd2388a672ccf154447201", "git_parents": ["f6c65a76248cf32742f7ea5728fd08bdf6770f90"], "node": "e433c202e8363eeda048c305c63d135df5eaee47", "parents": ["b041b12212a4d2340280bb4866a2263e33fcba46"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066262 [wpt PR 62181] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62181\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/resource-timing/response-status-code.html.ini"], "git_node": "90aad64636577799f8db66921711446b2c737d90", "git_parents": ["fb50129f431e9c5067cd2388a672ccf154447201"], "node": "a4c89796508f84feb06e1e60063ff472a6d94f4d", "parents": ["e433c202e8363eeda048c305c63d135df5eaee47"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Keren Zhu \u003ckerenzhu@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066312 [wpt PR 62183] - Ensure elements are scrolled into view in CSSOM View tests, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nEnsure elements are scrolled into view in CSSOM View tests\n\ndocument.elementFromPoint() and elementsFromPoint() return nullptr when\nthe point is out of viewport. If the browser window is too small, the\nWPT tests that use these APIs will fail. This CL fixes them by scrolling\nthe page to element before making those API calls.\n\nFixed: 551263526\nChange-Id: I0ab64484f0a4cab07806a00715399945fbe1bb65\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8275345\nReviewed-by: Cammie Smith Barnes \u003ccammie@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Keren Zhu \u003ckerenzhu@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1685234}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 01f5f8c7a5a9da93422005795c7caa54d614b364\nwpt-pr: 62183\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/cssom-view/elementFromPoint.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/cssom-view/elementsFromPoint.html"], "git_node": "9da7fafbdd69df7b60de52a494fcd17f0b64ab7b", "git_parents": ["90aad64636577799f8db66921711446b2c737d90"], "node": "38994f264efe1f0488bf2ec37c7438bd1973e87b", "parents": ["a4c89796508f84feb06e1e60063ff472a6d94f4d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066312 [wpt PR 62183] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62183\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/cssom-view/client-props-root-display-none-crash.html.ini"], "git_node": "9af0896900f4691354c7cd51e2fd2d06e78df60f", "git_parents": ["9da7fafbdd69df7b60de52a494fcd17f0b64ab7b"], "node": "f98975dafdbb0dc0dd0eea255951d4f9baec620e", "parents": ["38994f264efe1f0488bf2ec37c7438bd1973e87b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Hyowon Kim \u003chyowon@igalia.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066190 [wpt PR 62177] - Migrate MSE multiple-attach/sourcebufferlist coverage to WPT, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nMigrate MSE multiple-attach/sourcebufferlist coverage to WPT\n\nAdd the missing test cases to external/wpt/media-source/, then remove\nthe corresponding internal tests.\n\n- mediasource-multiple-attach.html: Test reattachment through a second\n  object URL after revoking the first.\n- mediasource-sourcebufferlist.html: Test activeSourceBuffers removal\n  events and out-of-range indexed access.\n\nBug: 485677942\nChange-Id: Id6bd265a7d0b20c165e18589c3860afa72949513\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8254912\nReviewed-by: Brian Sheedy \u003cbsheedy@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Hyowon Kim \u003chyowon@igalia.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1685237}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 6e5a86fa6a4fcde78d6fd720262d5e167b46233d\nwpt-pr: 62177\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/media-source/mediasource-multiple-attach.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/media-source/mediasource-sourcebufferlist.html"], "git_node": "77e51823042dae1382688e88e386ae588ba739d6", "git_parents": ["9af0896900f4691354c7cd51e2fd2d06e78df60f"], "node": "2f5428bb2c218c1c4dabcff25215aba10917ec41", "parents": ["f98975dafdbb0dc0dd0eea255951d4f9baec620e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Joey Arhar \u003cjarhar@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066316 [wpt PR 62184] - Add WPT for right clicking customizable select, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nAdd WPT for right clicking customizable select\n\nRight click is not supposed to open the picker:\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12733\n\nChange-Id: I25471ebeddeb0a545266da0272bdabba0ea4322d\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8277497\nReviewed-by: Mason Freed \u003cmasonf@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Joey Arhar \u003cjarhar@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Joey Arhar \u003cjarhar@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1685262}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 89a14102cafacaddeb6ab85f0ed2a1b424d2faba\nwpt-pr: 62184\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/semantics/forms/the-select-element/customizable-select/select-mouse-behavior.html"], "git_node": "926f2035a67d8237db08de0d358a0b31d944c8a4", "git_parents": ["77e51823042dae1382688e88e386ae588ba739d6"], "node": "a99be8d2f498f4148822eb9d455da13d1de69e80", "parents": ["2f5428bb2c218c1c4dabcff25215aba10917ec41"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066316 [wpt PR 62184] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62184\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/html/semantics/forms/the-select-element/customizable-select/all-revert-crash.html.ini"], "git_node": "2e97beae728d09c2d5933c31c58f525331295af1", "git_parents": ["926f2035a67d8237db08de0d358a0b31d944c8a4"], "node": "19785d26dedbe7230a78957c314e03c87332e40d", "parents": ["a99be8d2f498f4148822eb9d455da13d1de69e80"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sangwhan Moon \u003csxm@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065451 [wpt PR 62102] - [webvtt] Add VTTCue.lineAlign and positionAlign behind a flag, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[webvtt] Add VTTCue.lineAlign and positionAlign behind a flag\n\nlineAlign (\"start\"/\"center\"/\"end\") and positionAlign\n(\"line-left\"/\"center\"/\"line-right\"/\"auto\") are experimental and have no\nguarantees of being useful in the wild.\n\nNote: the flag gates the two IDL attributes only. The parser side comma\nsuffixes on the line and position settings changes, e.g. \"line:0%,start\"\nand \"position:50%,line-left\" - is a conformance fix that does not need\nto be flag guarded (default behavior is parse, but do nothing without\nflag). Keyword matching is exact per spec: a compound like \"startend\"\nor \"line-leftcenter\" voids the whole setting, and \"auto\" is not in the\ncolalign keyword list (it is only expressible through the IDL\nattribute).\n\nThe compound-keyword and position:...,auto cases are covered by\nextending the upstream settings-line and settings-position tests in\nexternal/wpt/webvtt/parsing/file-parsing (sources in support/*.test,\nregenerated with tools/build.py) rather than a Chromium unit test, so\nthe coverage is shared with other engines.\n\nI2S (approved 2017): https://chromestatus.com/feature/4905656217763840\n\nBug: 40652084\nChange-Id: Id5827b5cc822bcb6cec610713aaac1341e217b6e\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8253929\nReviewed-by: Rick Byers \u003crbyers@chromium.org\u003e\nAuto-Submit: Sangwhan Moon \u003csxm@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Sangwhan Moon \u003csxm@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Tommy Steimel \u003csteimel@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1685271}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 422734d7fd906113ab2e8a929e115bbcdfa5b341\nwpt-pr: 62102\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/webvtt/parsing/file-parsing/support/settings-line.test", "testing/web-platform/tests/webvtt/parsing/file-parsing/support/settings-position.test", "testing/web-platform/tests/webvtt/parsing/file-parsing/tests/settings-line.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webvtt/parsing/file-parsing/tests/settings-position.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webvtt/parsing/file-parsing/tests/support/settings-line.vtt", "testing/web-platform/tests/webvtt/parsing/file-parsing/tests/support/settings-position.vtt"], "git_node": "dd031caf8edd830782a956cb0777a2da1209934c", "git_parents": ["2e97beae728d09c2d5933c31c58f525331295af1"], "node": "aacd8f7469bd80b6f0c9d005f10bd0aa15524bf3", "parents": ["19785d26dedbe7230a78957c314e03c87332e40d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Blink WPT Bot \u003cblink-w3c-test-autoroller@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066365 [wpt PR 62055] - [webvtt] Test that :cue is rejected with a single colon, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[webvtt] Test that :cue is rejected with a single colon (#62055)\n\nBlink rejects :cue and :cue() in author sheets because\nCSSSelector::UpdatePseudoType() downgrades the pseudo type to\nkPseudoUnknown when there is only one colon, but nothing tested it:\ndeleting the bare \"cue\" entry in the without-arguments map would break\n::cue with no test failing.\n\nPin the invariant with a web platform test instead of a unit test so it\nis asserted at the web-observable layer (querySelector, insertRule,\nserialization round-trip, CSS.supports) and the coverage is shared with\nother engines through WPT export.\n\nBug: 40652084,1012242\nChange-Id: I98c4629082126b415a35544196749ea68487af88\n\nCo-authored-by: Sangwhan Moon \u003csxm@chromium.org\u003e\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 6b3a896514bae42a57974e4e7e4753761d70e51f\nwpt-pr: 62055\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/webvtt/api/cue-pseudo-parsing.html"], "git_node": "eb01349f24cda4a1872dd4014a8bfb119ec98e4c", "git_parents": ["dd031caf8edd830782a956cb0777a2da1209934c"], "node": "e97bf307f36d2503bb8d426aadc093fdf1688031", "parents": ["aacd8f7469bd80b6f0c9d005f10bd0aa15524bf3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066365 [wpt PR 62055] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62055\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/webvtt/api/cue-pseudo-parsing.html.ini"], "git_node": "078ee1be64d9695ad41f4a772229da5d9e1d460b", "git_parents": ["eb01349f24cda4a1872dd4014a8bfb119ec98e4c"], "node": "fe5d0f26d9bf1b6e3d52d7169270bc6597591f00", "parents": ["e97bf307f36d2503bb8d426aadc093fdf1688031"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Morten Stenshorne \u003cmstensho@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066370 [wpt PR 62185] - [RouteMatching] Rename :nav-source to :navigation-source., a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[RouteMatching] Rename :nav-source to :navigation-source.\n\nSee https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/pull/14385\n\nTAG=agy\nCONV=5fef718d-d18e-476f-9874-a28d32ed1fb9\n\nBug: 436805487\nChange-Id: I035f4f97869dfd5342b92a8810a2d8a9df9c13a7\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8278574\nReviewed-by: Noam Rosenthal \u003cnrosenthal@google.com\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Morten Stenshorne \u003cmstensho@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1685369}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: ef1cea845d70fb84127ff0e1aff2eeda7064f682\nwpt-pr: 62185\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-navigation/tentative/nav-source-001.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-navigation/tentative/navigation-source-001.html"], "git_node": "36b7888366ccc8611bd20fc80ec3897fd81719f8", "git_parents": ["078ee1be64d9695ad41f4a772229da5d9e1d460b"], "node": "3aceab4a8974fd007a0dfb77bfc385079518b4b9", "parents": ["fe5d0f26d9bf1b6e3d52d7169270bc6597591f00"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066370 [wpt PR 62185] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62185\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-navigation/tentative/nav-source-001.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-navigation/tentative/navigation-source-001.html.ini"], "git_node": "ec970239e0cba62474fe82745dc548eb51777c1b", "git_parents": ["36b7888366ccc8611bd20fc80ec3897fd81719f8"], "node": "bfb3976bec64c34368dd9a01057aac1b77a30326", "parents": ["3aceab4a8974fd007a0dfb77bfc385079518b4b9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moonira \u003cmoonira@google.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066392 [wpt PR 62186] - Match random() in custom function test according to spec resolution, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nMatch random() in custom function test according to spec resolution\n\nIn [0] it was resolved that:\n\nrandom() in custom function should work similar to the way it's cached\nin other css properties, except that element-scoped means that random()\nvalues are not just different between different elements but also\nbetween different function invocations. And for caching properties we\nuse either argument name, locals or 'result' property name.\n\n[0] https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13661#issuecomment-4672364617\n\nBug: 522310367, 413385732\nChange-Id: Ia653b9b6d46ea3db3508a0633601b061343caf37\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8251098\nReviewed-by: Anders Hartvoll Ruud \u003candruud@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Munira Tursunova \u003cmoonira@google.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1685470}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: ccd3b01e3efde96919c50925bb922e7e7e9784fb\nwpt-pr: 62186\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-values/random-in-custom-function.tentative.html"], "git_node": "13f9cce4b58abf5237c0f9c3c365b3c43d3578eb", "git_parents": ["ec970239e0cba62474fe82745dc548eb51777c1b"], "node": "bf5d518cfe04cd49f10172f1f8f068316865db8e", "parents": ["bfb3976bec64c34368dd9a01057aac1b77a30326"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066392 [wpt PR 62186] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62186\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-values/random-in-custom-function.tentative.html.ini"], "git_node": "e6f94bf2b7c5e05b1fbf5dfc1a0837dd2280ae7b", "git_parents": ["13f9cce4b58abf5237c0f9c3c365b3c43d3578eb"], "node": "7407c6136d72ba5d3c77f02d3d0486f2b4c68fd8", "parents": ["bf5d518cfe04cd49f10172f1f8f068316865db8e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "youennf \u003cyouennf@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066098 [wpt PR 62172] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=321191, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=321191 (#62172)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: a79064192af7b1a0adf17e09de7f253beb7c3c85\nwpt-pr: 62172\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/service-workers/service-worker/fetch-event.https.h2.html", "testing/we